window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a472-60076929a7a42a36.json"]={sha256:"60076929a7a42a368ddaa1de5b2d8168b96b37c08919e509ac68df903d295557",value:{"id":"a472","title":"天文高解析光譜儀","titleEn":"High-resolution astronomical spectrographs","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 HARPS 與 ESPRESSO 這類光纖饋入、真空溫控的階梯光柵光譜儀為對象，說明為何 1 m/s 的恆星速度只相當於偵測器上 18.7 nm 的譜線位移，再把階梯光柵與交叉色散、光展量與擾頻、環境穩定、ThAr／標準具／頻率梳校正、CCD 系統誤差與重心修正整合成可驗收的徑向速度量測鏈。","summaryEn":"Using fibre-fed, vacuum-stabilised echelle spectrographs such as HARPS and ESPRESSO, show why a 1 m/s stellar velocity is only an 18.7 nm line shift on the detector, then integrate echelle and cross-dispersion, étendue and scrambling, environmental stability, ThAr, etalon and comb calibration, CCD systematics and barycentric correction into an acceptable radial-velocity measurement chain.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-astronomical","subcategoryTitle":"天文儀器與科學感測器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Astronomical instrumentation and scientific sensors","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-astronomical","learningTags":["optics","optics-astronomical","spectrometer"],"architectureFamily":"spectrometer","architectureNodes":[["望遠鏡前端與導星","Telescope front end and guiding"],["光纖連結與擾頻器","Fibre link and scrambler"],["真空溫控階梯光柵光學","Vacuum-stabilised echelle optics"],["校正單元：ThAr、標準具、頻率梳","Calibration unit: ThAr, etalon, comb"],["低溫 CCD 與曝光計","Cryogenic CCD and exposure meter"],["萃取與 RV 管線","Extraction and RV pipeline"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[3,1],[2,4],[4,5],[0,5]],"diagram":{"type":"spectrometer","labels":["望遠鏡前端與導星","光纖連結與擾頻器","真空溫控階梯光柵光學","校正單元：ThAr、標準具、頻率梳","低溫 CCD 與曝光計"],"labelsEn":["Telescope front end and guiding","Fibre link and scrambler","Vacuum-stabilised echelle optics","Calibration unit: ThAr, etalon, comb","Cryogenic CCD and exposure meter"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"徑向速度預算練習：設計 R = 140 000、λ = 550 nm，每解析元素取樣 4 個 10 µm 像素，每像素 535 m/s，1 m/s = 18.7 nm。8.2 m 望遠鏡、1″ 光纖、R4 光柵需要 d_col = 140 000×4.85×10⁻⁶×8.2/8 = 0.70 m 的準直光束。環境：0.1 m 鋁支架在 1 mK 漂移下貢獻 0.12 m/s，10⁻⁵ hPa 的穩定真空貢獻 0.8 mm/s 可忽略。光子雜訊：Q = 15 000、N_e = 4×10⁹，σ = 3×10⁸/(15 000×6.32×10⁴) = 0.32 m/s。加入校正 0.10、光纖 0.10、偵測器 0.10、熱機構 0.12 m/s，總 RSS = √(0.316² + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.0144) = 0.38 m/s。要以 5σ 偵測半振幅 K = 0.09 m/s 的地球類行星，約需 N = 2×(5×0.38/0.09)² ≈ 890 次獨立量測，且尚未計入恆星活動。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Radial-velocity budget exercise: design for R = 140 000 at λ = 550 nm with four 10 µm pixels per resolution element, giving 535 m/s per pixel and 1 m/s = 18.7 nm. An 8.2 m telescope with a 1″ fibre and an R4 grating needs a collimated beam d_col = 140 000×4.85×10⁻⁶×8.2/8 = 0.70 m. Environment: a 0.1 m aluminium mount drifting 1 mK contributes 0.12 m/s, while a stable 10⁻⁵ hPa vacuum contributes a negligible 0.8 mm/s. Photon noise with Q = 15 000 and N_e = 4×10⁹ is σ = 3×10⁸/(15 000×6.32×10⁴) = 0.32 m/s. Adding calibration 0.10, fibre 0.10, detector 0.10 and thermo-mechanical 0.12 m/s gives a total RSS of √(0.316² + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.0144) = 0.38 m/s. Detecting an Earth analogue with semi-amplitude K = 0.09 m/s at 5σ then needs about N = 2×(5×0.38/0.09)² ≈ 890 independent measurements, before stellar activity is considered. Values are teaching assumptions, not any instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a472-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「徑向速度量測需求與解析力」與「階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power\" and \"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a472-v12-01","title":"徑向速度量測需求與解析力：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「恆星譜線的都卜勒位移」如何決定天文高解析光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Doppler shift of stellar lines” determines the key performance of “High-resolution astronomical spectrographs”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"系外行星繞行時使恆星沿視線方向週期性前後運動，恆星吸收譜線因都卜勒效應位移 δλ/λ = v/c。地球質量行星繞類太陽恆星一年軌道只造成約 9 cm/s 的速度半振幅，木星約 12.5 m/s，因此光譜儀必須在數千條譜線上量出遠小於一個像素的位移。解析力 R = λ/Δλ 決定譜線被分開與取樣的程度：R 越高譜線側翼越陡、每條線攜帶的速度資訊越多，但每個解析元素分到的光子越少，所以 R 的選擇是解析度、通量與儀器尺寸之間的取捨。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「恆星譜線的都卜勒位移」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"When an exoplanet orbits, its star moves periodically toward and away from us and its absorption lines shift by δλ/λ = v/c. An Earth-mass planet in a one-year orbit around a Sun-like star produces a velocity semi-amplitude of only about 9 cm/s and Jupiter about 12.5 m/s, so the spectrograph must measure shifts far smaller than a pixel across thousands of lines. Resolving power R = λ/Δλ sets how well lines are separated and sampled: higher R steepens line flanks and gives each line more velocity information, but spreads photons over more resolution elements, so choosing R trades resolution, throughput and instrument size. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Doppler shift of stellar lines”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：1 m/s 對應 δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹，在 λ = 550 nm 為 1.83 fm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: 1 m/s corresponds to δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹, or 1.83 fm at λ = 550 nm.","failure":"常見誤解：「解析力越高，RV 精度一定越好，不必考慮光子數。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Higher resolving power always improves RV precision regardless of photon count.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「恆星譜線的都卜勒位移」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Doppler shift of stellar lines”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-01-k1","title":"徑向速度量測需求與解析力","titleEn":"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power","text":"系外行星繞行時使恆星沿視線方向週期性前後運動，恆星吸收譜線因都卜勒效應位移 δλ/λ = v/c。地球質量行星繞類太陽恆星一年軌道只造成約 9 cm/s 的速度半振幅，木星約 12.5 m/s，因此光譜儀必須在數千條譜線上量出遠小於一個像素的位移。","textEn":"When an exoplanet orbits, its star moves periodically toward and away from us and its absorption lines shift by δλ/λ = v/c. An Earth-mass planet in a one-year orbit around a Sun-like star produces a velocity semi-amplitude of only about 9 cm/s and Jupiter about 12.5 m/s, so the spectrograph must measure shifts far smaller than a pixel across thousands of lines.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：解析力越高，RV 精度一定越好，不必考慮光子數。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Higher resolving power always improves RV precision regardless of photon count. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「徑向速度量測需求與解析力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power\" is correct?","options":["解析力越高，RV 精度一定越好，不必考慮光子數。","系外行星繞行時使恆星沿視線方向週期性前後運動，恆星吸收譜線因都卜勒效應位移 δλ/λ = v/c。","階梯光柵刻線越密，角色散就越大。"],"optionsEn":["Higher resolving power always improves RV precision regardless of photon count.","When an exoplanet orbits, its star moves periodically toward and away from us and its absorption lines shift by δλ/λ = v/c.","A more finely ruled echelle always gives larger angular dispersion."],"answer":1,"explanation":"系外行星繞行時使恆星沿視線方向週期性前後運動，恆星吸收譜線因都卜勒效應位移 δλ/λ = v/c。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"When an exoplanet orbits, its star moves periodically toward and away from us and its absorption lines shift by δλ/λ = v/c. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a472-v12-02","title":"徑向速度量測需求與解析力：定量估算","titleEn":"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「恆星譜線的都卜勒位移」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Doppler shift of stellar lines” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：1 m/s 對應 δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹，在 λ = 550 nm 為 1.83 fm。R = 140 000 時解析元素 Δλ = 550/140 000 = 3.93 pm，相當於 c/R = 2141 m/s；若每個解析元素取樣 4 個 10 µm 像素，每像素 535 m/s，1 m/s 等於偵測器上 10 µm/535 = 18.7 nm 的譜線位移，約為像素的 1/535。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: 1 m/s corresponds to δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹, or 1.83 fm at λ = 550 nm. At R = 140 000 the resolution element is Δλ = 550/140 000 = 3.93 pm, equivalent to c/R = 2141 m/s; sampled by four 10 µm pixels each pixel spans 535 m/s, so 1 m/s is a line shift of 10 µm/535 = 18.7 nm on the detector, about 1/535 of a pixel. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：觀測長期 RV 散佈小於 1 m/s 的 G、K 矮星與經月球或太陽望遠鏡導入的太陽光，量測譜線半高寬並換算實際交付的 R，與設計值比較；再用校正燈譜線的寬度與其佔用的像素數確認每像素的速度標度，寫入儀器設定檔供管線使用。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Observe G and K dwarfs whose long-term RV scatter is below 1 m/s and sunlight fed through the Moon or a solar telescope, measure line FWHM and convert to the delivered R for comparison with the design; then use calibration-line widths and the number of pixels they cover to confirm the velocity scale per pixel and store it in the instrument configuration used by the pipeline.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"1 m/s 對應 δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹，在 λ = 550 nm 為 1.83 fm。R = 140 000 時解析元素 Δλ = 550/140 000 = 3.93 pm，相當於 c/R = 2141 m/s；若每個解析元素取樣 4 個 10 µm 像素，每像素 535 m/s，1 m/s 等於偵測器上 10 µm/535 = 18.7 nm 的譜線位移，約為像素的 1/535。","textEn":"1 m/s corresponds to δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹, or 1.83 fm at λ = 550 nm. At R = 140 000 the resolution element is Δλ = 550/140 000 = 3.93 pm, equivalent to c/R = 2141 m/s; sampled by four 10 µm pixels each pixel spans 535 m/s, so 1 m/s is a line shift of 10 µm/535 = 18.7 nm on the detector, about 1/535 of a pixel.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「徑向速度量測需求與解析力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power\", which statement holds?","options":["只要光柵用零膨脹材料，溫度就不再重要。","曝光時間一直加倍，RV 誤差就會無限下降。","1 m/s 對應 δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹，在 λ = 550 nm 為 1.83 fm。"],"optionsEn":["If the grating is made of zero-expansion material, temperature no longer matters.","Doubling the exposure time keeps reducing RV error without limit.","1 m/s corresponds to δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹, or 1.83 fm at λ = 550 nm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"1 m/s 對應 δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹，在 λ = 550 nm 為 1.83 fm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"1 m/s corresponds to δλ/λ = 1/c = 3.34×10⁻⁹, or 1.83 fm at λ = 550 nm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a472-v12-03","title":"徑向速度量測需求與解析力：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「恆星譜線的都卜勒位移」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Doppler shift of stellar lines” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"觀測長期 RV 散佈小於 1 m/s 的 G、K 矮星與經月球或太陽望遠鏡導入的太陽光，量測譜線半高寬並換算實際交付的 R，與設計值比較；再用校正燈譜線的寬度與其佔用的像素數確認每像素的速度標度，寫入儀器設定檔供管線使用。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Observe G and K dwarfs whose long-term RV scatter is below 1 m/s and sunlight fed through the Moon or a solar telescope, measure line FWHM and convert to the delivered R for comparison with the design; then use calibration-line widths and the number of pixels they cover to confirm the velocity scale per pixel and store it in the instrument configuration used by the pipeline. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只看解析力規格而忽略取樣，每個解析元素少於 2 個像素時譜線欠取樣，像素內響應差異會轉成隨地球公轉速度改變的假訊號；反之若在口徑不足的望遠鏡上把 R 推得過高，每個解析元素的光子不足，RV 精度反而變差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Quoting resolving power while ignoring sampling leaves lines undersampled below 2 pixels per resolution element, so intrapixel response differences become spurious signals that vary with Earth's orbital velocity; conversely, pushing R too high on a small aperture starves each element of photons and degrades RV precision.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"觀測長期 RV 散佈小於 1 m/s 的 G、K 矮星與經月球或太陽望遠鏡導入的太陽光，量測譜線半高寬並換算實際交付的 R，與設計值比較；再用校正燈譜線的寬度與其佔用的像素數確認每像素的速度標度，寫入儀器設定檔供管線使用。","textEn":"Observe G and K dwarfs whose long-term RV scatter is below 1 m/s and sunlight fed through the Moon or a solar telescope, measure line FWHM and convert to the delivered R for comparison with the design; then use calibration-line widths and the number of pixels they cover to confirm the velocity scale per pixel and store it in the instrument configuration used by the pipeline.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「徑向速度量測需求與解析力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power\"?","options":["觀測長期 RV 散佈小於 1 m/s 的 G、K 矮星與經月球或太陽望遠鏡導入的太陽光，量測譜線半高寬並換算實際交付的 R，與設計值比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","CCD 像素是完美等距網格，只需校正波長即可。"],"optionsEn":["Observe G and K dwarfs whose long-term RV scatter is below 1 m/s and sunlight fed through the Moon or a solar telescope, measure line FWHM and convert to the delivered R for comparison with the design.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","CCD pixels form a perfect grid, so only wavelength needs calibrating."],"answer":0,"explanation":"觀測長期 RV 散佈小於 1 m/s 的 G、K 矮星與經月球或太陽望遠鏡導入的太陽光，量測譜線半高寬並換算實際交付的 R，與設計值比較；再用校正燈譜線的寬度與其佔用的像素數確認每像素的速度標度，寫入儀器設定檔供管線使用。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Observe G and K dwarfs whose long-term RV scatter is below 1 m/s and sunlight fed through the Moon or a solar telescope, measure line FWHM and convert to the delivered R for comparison with the design; then use calibration-line widths and the number of pixels they cover to confirm the velocity scale per pixel and store it in the instrument configuration used by the pipeline. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a472-v12-04","title":"徑向速度量測需求與解析力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「恆星譜線的都卜勒位移」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Doppler shift of stellar lines” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只看解析力規格而忽略取樣，每個解析元素少於 2 個像素時譜線欠取樣，像素內響應差異會轉成隨地球公轉速度改變的假訊號；反之若在口徑不足的望遠鏡上把 R 推得過高，每個解析元素的光子不足，RV 精度反而變差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Quoting resolving power while ignoring sampling leaves lines undersampled below 2 pixels per resolution element, so intrapixel response differences become spurious signals that vary with Earth's orbital velocity; conversely, pushing R too high on a small aperture starves each element of photons and degrades RV precision. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：解析力 R = λ/Δλ 決定譜線被分開與取樣的程度：R 越高譜線側翼越陡、每條線攜帶的速度資訊越多，但每個解析元素分到的光子越少，所以 R 的選擇是解析度、通量與儀器尺寸之間的取捨。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Resolving power R = λ/Δλ sets how well lines are separated and sampled: higher R steepens line flanks and gives each line more velocity information, but spreads photons over more resolution elements, so choosing R trades resolution, throughput and instrument size.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「解析力越高，RV 精度一定越好，不必考慮光子數。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Higher resolving power always improves RV precision regardless of photon count.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只看解析力規格而忽略取樣，每個解析元素少於 2 個像素時譜線欠取樣，像素內響應差異會轉成隨地球公轉速度改變的假訊號；反之若在口徑不足的望遠鏡上把 R 推得過高，每個解析元素的光子不足，RV 精度反而變差。","textEn":"Quoting resolving power while ignoring sampling leaves lines undersampled below 2 pixels per resolution element, so intrapixel response differences become spurious signals that vary with Earth's orbital velocity; conversely, pushing R too high on a small aperture starves each element of photons and degrades RV precision.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「徑向速度量測需求與解析力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Radial-velocity requirements and resolving power\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","只看解析力規格而忽略取樣，每個解析元素少於 2 個像素時譜線欠取樣，像素內響應差異會轉成隨地球公轉速度改變的假訊號。","階梯光柵刻線越密，角色散就越大。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Quoting resolving power while ignoring sampling leaves lines undersampled below 2 pixels per resolution element, so intrapixel response differences become spurious signals that vary with Earth's orbital velocity.","A more finely ruled echelle always gives larger angular dispersion."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只看解析力規格而忽略取樣，每個解析元素少於 2 個像素時譜線欠取樣，像素內響應差異會轉成隨地球公轉速度改變的假訊號；反之若在口徑不足的望遠鏡上把 R 推得過高，每個解析元素的光子不足，RV 精度反而變差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Quoting resolving power while ignoring sampling leaves lines undersampled below 2 pixels per resolution element, so intrapixel response differences become spurious signals that vary with Earth's orbital velocity; conversely, pushing R too high on a small aperture starves each element of photons and degrades RV precision. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a472-v12-05","title":"階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「R4 階梯光柵與交叉色散器」如何決定天文高解析光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “R4 echelle and cross-disperser” determines the key performance of “High-resolution astronomical spectrographs”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"階梯光柵以每毫米數十條的粗刻線在大入射角、高繞射級（m 約 60 到 160）下工作，滿足 mλ = d(sinα + sinβ)。在 Littrow 配置 α ≈ β ≈ θ_B，角色散 dβ/dλ = 2tanθ_B/λ 只取決於閃耀角，因此 R4（tanθ_B = 4）光柵的角色散比一般一級光柵高一個數量級。代價是相鄰繞射級重疊，每一級只有很窄的自由光譜範圍 FSR = λ/m，所以要用稜鏡或低刻線密度光柵在垂直方向做交叉色散，把數十個繞射級排成二維梯狀影像鋪滿大面積 CCD。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「R4 階梯光柵與交叉色散器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An echelle uses coarse rulings of tens of grooves per millimetre at steep incidence and high orders, m of about 60 to 160, obeying mλ = d(sinα + sinβ). In Littrow, α ≈ β ≈ θ_B, the angular dispersion dβ/dλ = 2tanθ_B/λ depends only on the blaze angle, so an R4 grating with tanθ_B = 4 disperses an order of magnitude more than a first-order grating. The price is overlapping orders, each with a narrow free spectral range FSR = λ/m, so a prism or low-groove-density grating cross-disperses perpendicular to the echelle and stacks dozens of orders into a two-dimensional ladder that tiles a large CCD. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “R4 echelle and cross-disperser”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：31.6 gr/mm 的 R4 光柵 d = 31.65 µm、θ_B = 75.96°。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: An R4 grating with 31.6 gr/mm has d = 31.65 µm and θ_B = 75.96°.","failure":"常見誤解：「階梯光柵刻線越密，角色散就越大。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A more finely ruled echelle always gives larger angular dispersion.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「R4 階梯光柵與交叉色散器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “R4 echelle and cross-disperser”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-05-k1","title":"階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散","titleEn":"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion","text":"階梯光柵以每毫米數十條的粗刻線在大入射角、高繞射級（m 約 60 到 160）下工作，滿足 mλ = d(sinα + sinβ)。在 Littrow 配置 α ≈ β ≈ θ_B，角色散 dβ/dλ = 2tanθ_B/λ 只取決於閃耀角，因此 R4（tanθ_B = 4）光柵的角色散比一般一級光柵高一個數量級。","textEn":"An echelle uses coarse rulings of tens of grooves per millimetre at steep incidence and high orders, m of about 60 to 160, obeying mλ = d(sinα + sinβ). In Littrow, α ≈ β ≈ θ_B, the angular dispersion dβ/dλ = 2tanθ_B/λ depends only on the blaze angle, so an R4 grating with tanθ_B = 4 disperses an order of magnitude more than a first-order grating.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：階梯光柵刻線越密，角色散就越大。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A more finely ruled echelle always gives larger angular dispersion. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion\" is correct?","options":["階梯光柵刻線越密，角色散就越大。","光纖只是傳光線，對 RV 精度沒有影響。","階梯光柵以每毫米數十條的粗刻線在大入射角、高繞射級（m 約 60 到 160）下工作，滿足 mλ = d(sinα + sinβ)。"],"optionsEn":["A more finely ruled echelle always gives larger angular dispersion.","A fibre only carries light and has no effect on RV precision.","An echelle uses coarse rulings of tens of grooves per millimetre at steep incidence and high orders, m of about 60 to 160, obeying mλ = d(sinα + sinβ)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"階梯光柵以每毫米數十條的粗刻線在大入射角、高繞射級（m 約 60 到 160）下工作，滿足 mλ = d(sinα + sinβ)。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An echelle uses coarse rulings of tens of grooves per millimetre at steep incidence and high orders, m of about 60 to 160, obeying mλ = d(sinα + sinβ). The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a472-v12-06","title":"階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散：定量估算","titleEn":"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「R4 階梯光柵與交叉色散器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “R4 echelle and cross-disperser” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：31.6 gr/mm 的 R4 光柵 d = 31.65 µm、θ_B = 75.96°。Littrow 下 m = 2d·sinθ_B/λ = 2×31.65×0.970/0.550 ≈ 111.6，取 m = 112，閃耀波長 548.2 nm，FSR = 548.2/112 ≈ 4.89 nm。角色散 2×4/550 nm = 14.5 mrad/nm；相機焦距 0.70 m 時線色散 10.2 µm/pm，3.93 pm 的解析元素佔 40 µm，即 4 個 10 µm 像素。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: An R4 grating with 31.6 gr/mm has d = 31.65 µm and θ_B = 75.96°. In Littrow, m = 2d·sinθ_B/λ = 2×31.65×0.970/0.550 ≈ 111.6, so order 112 blazes at 548.2 nm with FSR = 548.2/112 ≈ 4.89 nm. Angular dispersion is 2×4/550 nm = 14.5 mrad/nm; a 0.70 m camera gives 10.2 µm/pm, so a 3.93 pm resolution element covers 40 µm, four 10 µm pixels. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 ThAr 燈與平場光照亮全部繞射級，追蹤每一級在偵測器上的軌跡，確認相鄰級間距大於光纖像在交叉色散方向的寬度再加背景餘量；以已知波長譜線核對各級的 m 值與色散解，並檢查閃耀函數峰值落在各級中央，自由光譜範圍邊緣的效率約降到峰值的 40%。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Illuminate all orders with a ThAr lamp and a flat field, trace each order across the detector and confirm that inter-order spacing exceeds the fibre-image width in the cross-dispersion direction plus a background margin; check each order's m and dispersion solution against known lines and verify that the blaze peak sits at order centre with efficiency near 40% of peak at the free-spectral-range edges.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"31.6 gr/mm 的 R4 光柵 d = 31.65 µm、θ_B = 75.96°。Littrow 下 m = 2d·sinθ_B/λ = 2×31.65×0.970/0.550 ≈ 111.6，取 m = 112，閃耀波長 548.2 nm，FSR = 548.2/112 ≈ 4.89 nm。角色散 2×4/550 nm = 14.5 mrad/nm；相機焦距 0.70 m 時線色散 10.2 µm/pm，3.93 pm 的解析元素佔 40 µm，即 4 個 10 µm 像素。","textEn":"An R4 grating with 31.6 gr/mm has d = 31.65 µm and θ_B = 75.96°. In Littrow, m = 2d·sinθ_B/λ = 2×31.65×0.970/0.550 ≈ 111.6, so order 112 blazes at 548.2 nm with FSR = 548.2/112 ≈ 4.89 nm. Angular dispersion is 2×4/550 nm = 14.5 mrad/nm; a 0.70 m camera gives 10.2 µm/pm, so a 3.93 pm resolution element covers 40 µm, four 10 µm pixels.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion\", which statement holds?","options":["31.6 gr/mm 的 R4 光柵 d = 31.65 µm、θ_B = 75.96°。","ThAr 譜線夠多就能精準校正，不需要其他光源。","CCD 像素是完美等距網格，只需校正波長即可。"],"optionsEn":["An R4 grating with 31.6 gr/mm has d = 31.65 µm and θ_B = 75.96°.","Enough ThAr lines alone give precise calibration without any other source.","CCD pixels form a perfect grid, so only wavelength needs calibrating."],"answer":0,"explanation":"31.6 gr/mm 的 R4 光柵 d = 31.65 µm、θ_B = 75.96°。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"An R4 grating with 31.6 gr/mm has d = 31.65 µm and θ_B = 75.96°. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a472-v12-07","title":"階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「R4 階梯光柵與交叉色散器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “R4 echelle and cross-disperser” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 ThAr 燈與平場光照亮全部繞射級，追蹤每一級在偵測器上的軌跡，確認相鄰級間距大於光纖像在交叉色散方向的寬度再加背景餘量；以已知波長譜線核對各級的 m 值與色散解，並檢查閃耀函數峰值落在各級中央，自由光譜範圍邊緣的效率約降到峰值的 40%。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Illuminate all orders with a ThAr lamp and a flat field, trace each order across the detector and confirm that inter-order spacing exceeds the fibre-image width in the cross-dispersion direction plus a background margin; check each order's m and dispersion solution against known lines and verify that the blaze peak sits at order centre with efficiency near 40% of peak at the free-spectral-range edges. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：以稜鏡做交叉色散時紅端繞射級彼此靠近，光纖像翼部與散射光互相污染，背景扣除錯誤會讓深吸收線變淺並系統性移動譜線重心；光柵刻線的週期性誤差則產生 Rowland 鬼線，可能被誤認為恆星譜線而進入交叉相關遮罩。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: With prism cross-dispersion the red orders crowd together, fibre-image wings and scattered light contaminate neighbours, and wrong background subtraction makes deep lines shallower and systematically moves their centroids; periodic ruling errors create Rowland ghosts that can be mistaken for stellar lines and enter the cross-correlation mask.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 ThAr 燈與平場光照亮全部繞射級，追蹤每一級在偵測器上的軌跡，確認相鄰級間距大於光纖像在交叉色散方向的寬度再加背景餘量；以已知波長譜線核對各級的 m 值與色散解，並檢查閃耀函數峰值落在各級中央，自由光譜範圍邊緣的效率約降到峰值的 40%。","textEn":"Illuminate all orders with a ThAr lamp and a flat field, trace each order across the detector and confirm that inter-order spacing exceeds the fibre-image width in the cross-dispersion direction plus a background margin; check each order's m and dispersion solution against known lines and verify that the blaze peak sits at order centre with efficiency near 40% of peak at the free-spectral-range edges.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以 ThAr 燈與平場光照亮全部繞射級，追蹤每一級在偵測器上的軌跡，確認相鄰級間距大於光纖像在交叉色散方向的寬度再加背景餘量。","重心修正只要用曝光開始時間計算即可。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Illuminate all orders with a ThAr lamp and a flat field, trace each order across the detector and confirm that inter-order spacing exceeds the fibre-image width in the cross-dispersion direction plus a background margin.","Barycentric correction can simply use the exposure start time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以 ThAr 燈與平場光照亮全部繞射級，追蹤每一級在偵測器上的軌跡，確認相鄰級間距大於光纖像在交叉色散方向的寬度再加背景餘量；以已知波長譜線核對各級的 m 值與色散解，並檢查閃耀函數峰值落在各級中央，自由光譜範圍邊緣的效率約降到峰值的 40%。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Illuminate all orders with a ThAr lamp and a flat field, trace each order across the detector and confirm that inter-order spacing exceeds the fibre-image width in the cross-dispersion direction plus a background margin; check each order's m and dispersion solution against known lines and verify that the blaze peak sits at order centre with efficiency near 40% of peak at the free-spectral-range edges. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a472-v12-08","title":"階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散：失效診斷","titleEn":"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「R4 階梯光柵與交叉色散器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “R4 echelle and cross-disperser” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"以稜鏡做交叉色散時紅端繞射級彼此靠近，光纖像翼部與散射光互相污染，背景扣除錯誤會讓深吸收線變淺並系統性移動譜線重心；光柵刻線的週期性誤差則產生 Rowland 鬼線，可能被誤認為恆星譜線而進入交叉相關遮罩。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"With prism cross-dispersion the red orders crowd together, fibre-image wings and scattered light contaminate neighbours, and wrong background subtraction makes deep lines shallower and systematically moves their centroids; periodic ruling errors create Rowland ghosts that can be mistaken for stellar lines and enter the cross-correlation mask. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：代價是相鄰繞射級重疊，每一級只有很窄的自由光譜範圍 FSR = λ/m，所以要用稜鏡或低刻線密度光柵在垂直方向做交叉色散，把數十個繞射級排成二維梯狀影像鋪滿大面積 CCD。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The price is overlapping orders, each with a narrow free spectral range FSR = λ/m, so a prism or low-groove-density grating cross-disperses perpendicular to the echelle and stacks dozens of orders into a two-dimensional ladder that tiles a large CCD.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「階梯光柵刻線越密，角色散就越大。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A more finely ruled echelle always gives larger angular dispersion.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"以稜鏡做交叉色散時紅端繞射級彼此靠近，光纖像翼部與散射光互相污染，背景扣除錯誤會讓深吸收線變淺並系統性移動譜線重心；光柵刻線的週期性誤差則產生 Rowland 鬼線，可能被誤認為恆星譜線而進入交叉相關遮罩。","textEn":"With prism cross-dispersion the red orders crowd together, fibre-image wings and scattered light contaminate neighbours, and wrong background subtraction makes deep lines shallower and systematically moves their centroids; periodic ruling errors create Rowland ghosts that can be mistaken for stellar lines and enter the cross-correlation mask.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「階梯光柵方程式、繞射級與交叉色散」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Echelle grating equation, orders and cross-dispersion\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","光纖只是傳光線，對 RV 精度沒有影響。","以稜鏡做交叉色散時紅端繞射級彼此靠近，光纖像翼部與散射光互相污染，背景扣除錯誤會讓深吸收線變淺並系統性移動譜線重心。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A fibre only carries light and has no effect on RV precision.","With prism cross-dispersion the red orders crowd together, fibre-image wings and scattered light contaminate neighbours, and wrong background subtraction makes deep lines shallower and systematically moves their centroids."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以稜鏡做交叉色散時紅端繞射級彼此靠近，光纖像翼部與散射光互相污染，背景扣除錯誤會讓深吸收線變淺並系統性移動譜線重心；光柵刻線的週期性誤差則產生 Rowland 鬼線，可能被誤認為恆星譜線而進入交叉相關遮罩。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With prism cross-dispersion the red orders crowd together, fibre-image wings and scattered light contaminate neighbours, and wrong background subtraction makes deep lines shallower and systematically moves their centroids; periodic ruling errors create Rowland ghosts that can be mistaken for stellar lines and enter the cross-correlation mask. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a472-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割」與「真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing\" and \"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a472-v12-09","title":"光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「光纖饋入與擾頻器」如何決定天文高解析光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Fibre feed and scrambler” determines the key performance of “High-resolution astronomical spectrographs”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"對狹縫限制的光譜儀，R·φ·D_T = 2·d_col·tanθ_B：望遠鏡口徑 D_T 越大、天空孔徑 φ 越大，要維持同樣的 R 就需要越大的準直光束與光柵，這是 8 m 級望遠鏡高解析光譜儀體積龐大的根源。光纖把望遠鏡焦面與溫控光譜儀分開，並以擾頻讓輸出的近場與遠場不再跟隨輸入光點位置；八角形或方形芯光纖改善近場擾頻，雙擾頻器以透鏡交換近場與遠場。瞳切割與變形光學把光束切半或壓縮單一方向，等效縮小所需的光柵尺寸。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「光纖饋入與擾頻器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"For a slit-limited spectrograph R·φ·D_T = 2·d_col·tanθ_B: a larger telescope aperture D_T or sky aperture φ demands a larger collimated beam and grating for the same R, which is why high-resolution spectrographs on 8 m telescopes are so large. Fibres separate the telescope focus from the thermally controlled spectrograph and scramble the light so the output near and far fields no longer follow the input spot position; octagonal or square cores improve near-field scrambling and a double scrambler swaps near and far fields with lenses. Pupil slicing and anamorphic optics split the beam or compress one axis, effectively shrinking the grating required. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Fibre feed and scrambler”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad、D_T = 8.2 m、R4：R = 140 000 需 d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m，R = 190 000 需 0.94 m；3.6 m 望遠鏡在 R = 115 000 只需 0.25 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad, D_T = 8.2 m and R4, R = 140 000 needs d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m and R = 190 000 needs 0.94 m, while a 3.6 m telescope at R = 115 000 needs only 0.25 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「光纖只是傳光線，對 RV 精度沒有影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A fibre only carries light and has no effect on RV precision.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「光纖饋入與擾頻器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Fibre feed and scrambler”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-09-k1","title":"光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割","titleEn":"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing","text":"對狹縫限制的光譜儀，R·φ·D_T = 2·d_col·tanθ_B：望遠鏡口徑 D_T 越大、天空孔徑 φ 越大，要維持同樣的 R 就需要越大的準直光束與光柵，這是 8 m 級望遠鏡高解析光譜儀體積龐大的根源。光纖把望遠鏡焦面與溫控光譜儀分開，並以擾頻讓輸出的近場與遠場不再跟隨輸入光點位置；八角形或方形芯光纖改善近場擾頻，雙擾頻器以透鏡交換近場與遠場。","textEn":"For a slit-limited spectrograph R·φ·D_T = 2·d_col·tanθ_B: a larger telescope aperture D_T or sky aperture φ demands a larger collimated beam and grating for the same R, which is why high-resolution spectrographs on 8 m telescopes are so large. Fibres separate the telescope focus from the thermally controlled spectrograph and scramble the light so the output near and far fields no longer follow the input spot position; octagonal or square cores improve near-field scrambling and a double scrambler swaps near and far fields with lenses.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：光纖只是傳光線，對 RV 精度沒有影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A fibre only carries light and has no effect on RV precision. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing\" is correct?","options":["對狹縫限制的光譜儀，R·φ·D_T = 2·d_col·tanθ_B：望遠鏡口徑 D_T 越大、天空孔徑 φ 越大，要維持同樣的 R 就需要越大的準直光束與光柵，這是 8 m 級望遠鏡高解析光譜儀體積龐大的根源。","光纖只是傳光線，對 RV 精度沒有影響。","只要光柵用零膨脹材料，溫度就不再重要。"],"optionsEn":["For a slit-limited spectrograph R·φ·D_T = 2·d_col·tanθ_B: a larger telescope aperture D_T or sky aperture φ demands a larger collimated beam and grating for the same R, which is why high-resolution spectrographs on 8 m telescopes are so large.","A fibre only carries light and has no effect on RV precision.","If the grating is made of zero-expansion material, temperature no longer matters."],"answer":0,"explanation":"對狹縫限制的光譜儀，R·φ·D_T = 2·d_col·tanθ_B：望遠鏡口徑 D_T 越大、天空孔徑 φ 越大，要維持同樣的 R 就需要越大的準直光束與光柵，這是 8 m 級望遠鏡高解析光譜儀體積龐大的根源。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"For a slit-limited spectrograph R·φ·D_T = 2·d_col·tanθ_B: a larger telescope aperture D_T or sky aperture φ demands a larger collimated beam and grating for the same R, which is why high-resolution spectrographs on 8 m telescopes are so large. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a472-v12-10","title":"光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割：定量估算","titleEn":"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「光纖饋入與擾頻器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Fibre feed and scrambler” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad、D_T = 8.2 m、R4：R = 140 000 需 d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m，R = 190 000 需 0.94 m；3.6 m 望遠鏡在 R = 115 000 只需 0.25 m。擾頻：導星誤差使光點移動 10% 狹縫寬時，無擾頻位移 0.1×c/R = 214 m/s，擾頻增益 10⁴ 時降為 2.1 cm/s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad, D_T = 8.2 m and R4, R = 140 000 needs d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m and R = 190 000 needs 0.94 m, while a 3.6 m telescope at R = 115 000 needs only 0.25 m. Scrambling: a guiding error moving the spot by 10% of the slit width shifts lines by 0.1×c/R = 214 m/s unscrambled, but only 2.1 cm/s with a scrambling gain of 10⁴. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在實驗室把光點於光纖入口面逐步偏移，以光譜儀量譜線重心變化，或以相機直接拍攝輸出近場與遠場的光重心，擾頻增益等於輸入相對位移除以輸出相對位移；同時量測焦比劣化，確認輸出光錐不超出準直鏡接受角而造成光損與照明變化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: In the lab, step the spot across the fibre entrance and measure the line-centroid change with the spectrograph, or image the output near and far fields directly with a camera; scrambling gain is the relative input displacement divided by the relative output displacement.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad、D_T = 8.2 m、R4：R = 140 000 需 d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m，R = 190 000 需 0.94 m；3.6 m 望遠鏡在 R = 115 000 只需 0.25 m。擾頻：導星誤差使光點移動 10% 狹縫寬時，無擾頻位移 0.1×c/R = 214 m/s，擾頻增益 10⁴ 時降為 2.1 cm/s。","textEn":"With φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad, D_T = 8.2 m and R4, R = 140 000 needs d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m and R = 190 000 needs 0.94 m, while a 3.6 m telescope at R = 115 000 needs only 0.25 m. Scrambling: a guiding error moving the spot by 10% of the slit width shifts lines by 0.1×c/R = 214 m/s unscrambled, but only 2.1 cm/s with a scrambling gain of 10⁴.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing\", which statement holds?","options":["曝光時間一直加倍，RV 誤差就會無限下降。","φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad、D_T = 8.2 m、R4：R = 140 000 需 d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m，R = 190 000 需 0.94 m。","重心修正只要用曝光開始時間計算即可。"],"optionsEn":["Doubling the exposure time keeps reducing RV error without limit.","With φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad, D_T = 8.2 m and R4, R = 140 000 needs d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m and R = 190 000 needs 0.94 m, while a 3.6 m telescope at R = 115 000 needs only 0.25 m.","Barycentric correction can simply use the exposure start time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad、D_T = 8.2 m、R4：R = 140 000 需 d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m，R = 190 000 需 0.94 m；3.6 m 望遠鏡在 R = 115 000 只需 0.25 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With φ = 1″ = 4.85 µrad, D_T = 8.2 m and R4, R = 140 000 needs d_col = R·φ·D_T/(2×4) = 0.70 m and R = 190 000 needs 0.94 m, while a 3.6 m telescope at R = 115 000 needs only 0.25 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a472-v12-11","title":"光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「光纖饋入與擾頻器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Fibre feed and scrambler” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在實驗室把光點於光纖入口面逐步偏移，以光譜儀量譜線重心變化，或以相機直接拍攝輸出近場與遠場的光重心，擾頻增益等於輸入相對位移除以輸出相對位移；同時量測焦比劣化，確認輸出光錐不超出準直鏡接受角而造成光損與照明變化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"In the lab, step the spot across the fibre entrance and measure the line-centroid change with the spectrograph, or image the output near and far fields directly with a camera; scrambling gain is the relative input displacement divided by the relative output displacement. Also measure focal-ratio degradation to ensure the output cone stays within the collimator acceptance and causes neither light loss nor illumination changes. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：圓形芯光纖的近場擾頻不完全，導星偏移與大氣色散沿光纖殘留成 m/s 級速度誤差；光纖受彎曲與應力時產生模態雜訊，在高訊噪比光譜中形成無法平均掉的斑紋，直接限制校正源與亮星的精度。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Circular-core fibres scramble the near field incompletely, so guiding offsets and atmospheric dispersion leak through as m/s-level velocity errors; bending and stress create modal noise, a speckle pattern that does not average out at high SNR and directly limits the precision on calibration sources and bright stars.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在實驗室把光點於光纖入口面逐步偏移，以光譜儀量譜線重心變化，或以相機直接拍攝輸出近場與遠場的光重心，擾頻增益等於輸入相對位移除以輸出相對位移；同時量測焦比劣化，確認輸出光錐不超出準直鏡接受角而造成光損與照明變化。","textEn":"In the lab, step the spot across the fibre entrance and measure the line-centroid change with the spectrograph, or image the output near and far fields directly with a camera; scrambling gain is the relative input displacement divided by the relative output displacement. Also measure focal-ratio degradation to ensure the output cone stays within the collimator acceptance and causes neither light loss nor illumination changes.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","解析力越高，RV 精度一定越好，不必考慮光子數。","在實驗室把光點於光纖入口面逐步偏移，以光譜儀量譜線重心變化，或以相機直接拍攝輸出近場與遠場的光重心，擾頻增益等於輸入相對位移除以輸出相對位移。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Higher resolving power always improves RV precision regardless of photon count.","In the lab, step the spot across the fibre entrance and measure the line-centroid change with the spectrograph, or image the output near and far fields directly with a camera."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在實驗室把光點於光纖入口面逐步偏移，以光譜儀量譜線重心變化，或以相機直接拍攝輸出近場與遠場的光重心，擾頻增益等於輸入相對位移除以輸出相對位移；同時量測焦比劣化，確認輸出光錐不超出準直鏡接受角而造成光損與照明變化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"In the lab, step the spot across the fibre entrance and measure the line-centroid change with the spectrograph, or image the output near and far fields directly with a camera; scrambling gain is the relative input displacement divided by the relative output displacement. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a472-v12-12","title":"光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割：失效診斷","titleEn":"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「光纖饋入與擾頻器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Fibre feed and scrambler” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"圓形芯光纖的近場擾頻不完全，導星偏移與大氣色散沿光纖殘留成 m/s 級速度誤差；光纖受彎曲與應力時產生模態雜訊，在高訊噪比光譜中形成無法平均掉的斑紋，直接限制校正源與亮星的精度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Circular-core fibres scramble the near field incompletely, so guiding offsets and atmospheric dispersion leak through as m/s-level velocity errors; bending and stress create modal noise, a speckle pattern that does not average out at high SNR and directly limits the precision on calibration sources and bright stars. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：瞳切割與變形光學把光束切半或壓縮單一方向，等效縮小所需的光柵尺寸。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Pupil slicing and anamorphic optics split the beam or compress one axis, effectively shrinking the grating required.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「光纖只是傳光線，對 RV 精度沒有影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A fibre only carries light and has no effect on RV precision.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"圓形芯光纖的近場擾頻不完全，導星偏移與大氣色散沿光纖殘留成 m/s 級速度誤差；光纖受彎曲與應力時產生模態雜訊，在高訊噪比光譜中形成無法平均掉的斑紋，直接限制校正源與亮星的精度。","textEn":"Circular-core fibres scramble the near field incompletely, so guiding offsets and atmospheric dispersion leak through as m/s-level velocity errors; bending and stress create modal noise, a speckle pattern that does not average out at high SNR and directly limits the precision on calibration sources and bright stars.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光展量、光纖擾頻與瞳切割」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Étendue, fibre scrambling and pupil slicing\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["圓形芯光纖的近場擾頻不完全，導星偏移與大氣色散沿光纖殘留成 m/s 級速度誤差。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要光柵用零膨脹材料，溫度就不再重要。"],"optionsEn":["Circular-core fibres scramble the near field incompletely, so guiding offsets and atmospheric dispersion leak through as m/s-level velocity errors.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","If the grating is made of zero-expansion material, temperature no longer matters."],"answer":0,"explanation":"圓形芯光纖的近場擾頻不完全，導星偏移與大氣色散沿光纖殘留成 m/s 級速度誤差；光纖受彎曲與應力時產生模態雜訊，在高訊噪比光譜中形成無法平均掉的斑紋，直接限制校正源與亮星的精度。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Circular-core fibres scramble the near field incompletely, so guiding offsets and atmospheric dispersion leak through as m/s-level velocity errors; bending and stress create modal noise, a speckle pattern that does not average out at high SNR and directly limits the precision on calibration sources and bright stars. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a472-v12-13","title":"真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「真空容器與溫控屏蔽」如何決定天文高解析光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Vacuum vessel and thermal shields” determines the key performance of “High-resolution astronomical spectrographs”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"光譜儀內任何環境變化都會直接變成譜線位移：空氣折射率 n − 1 ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁴ 隨壓力改變而使所有波長整體平移，溫度則改變光柵週期、光學座長度與偵測器位置。因此 HARPS 與 ESPRESSO 類儀器把光學平台放進真空容器，外加多層主動溫控屏蔽，以 mK 等級的長期穩定為目標；光學座採用低膨脹材料或同材料對稱結構，偵測器有獨立的低溫恆溫器，電子設備與真空泵等熱源移到容器之外。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「真空容器與溫控屏蔽」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Any environmental change inside a spectrograph becomes a line shift: the refractive index of air, n − 1 ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁴, varies with pressure and translates all wavelengths together, while temperature changes grating period, bench length and detector position. HARPS- and ESPRESSO-class instruments therefore put the optical bench inside a vacuum vessel wrapped in nested actively controlled thermal shields aiming at mK-level long-term stability; benches use low-expansion or symmetric same-material structures, the detector has its own cryostat, and heat sources such as electronics and vacuum pumps are moved outside the vessel. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Vacuum vessel and thermal shields”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：空氣 dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷/hPa，每 1 hPa 壓力變化造成 c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s 的假速度；抽到 10⁻⁵ hPa 並保持穩定時降為 0.8 mm/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Air has dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷ per hPa, so a 1 hPa pressure change fakes c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s, falling to 0.8 mm/s when pumped to a stable 10⁻⁵ hPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要光柵用零膨脹材料，溫度就不再重要。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the grating is made of zero-expansion material, temperature no longer matters.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「真空容器與溫控屏蔽」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Vacuum vessel and thermal shields”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-13-k1","title":"真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計","titleEn":"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability","text":"光譜儀內任何環境變化都會直接變成譜線位移：空氣折射率 n − 1 ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁴ 隨壓力改變而使所有波長整體平移，溫度則改變光柵週期、光學座長度與偵測器位置。因此 HARPS 與 ESPRESSO 類儀器把光學平台放進真空容器，外加多層主動溫控屏蔽，以 mK 等級的長期穩定為目標；光學座採用低膨脹材料或同材料對稱結構，偵測器有獨立的低溫恆溫器，電子設備與真空泵等熱源移到容器之外。","textEn":"Any environmental change inside a spectrograph becomes a line shift: the refractive index of air, n − 1 ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁴, varies with pressure and translates all wavelengths together, while temperature changes grating period, bench length and detector position. HARPS- and ESPRESSO-class instruments therefore put the optical bench inside a vacuum vessel wrapped in nested actively controlled thermal shields aiming at mK-level long-term stability; benches use low-expansion or symmetric same-material structures, the detector has its own cryostat, and heat sources such as electronics and vacuum pumps are moved outside the vessel.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要光柵用零膨脹材料，溫度就不再重要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the grating is made of zero-expansion material, temperature no longer matters. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability\" is correct?","options":["只要光柵用零膨脹材料，溫度就不再重要。","光譜儀內任何環境變化都會直接變成譜線位移：空氣折射率 n − 1 ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁴ 隨壓力改變而使所有波長整體平移，溫度則改變光柵週期、光學座長度與偵測器位置。","ThAr 譜線夠多就能精準校正，不需要其他光源。"],"optionsEn":["If the grating is made of zero-expansion material, temperature no longer matters.","Any environmental change inside a spectrograph becomes a line shift: the refractive index of air, n − 1 ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁴, varies with pressure and translates all wavelengths together, while temperature changes grating period, bench length and detector position.","Enough ThAr lines alone give precise calibration without any other source."],"answer":1,"explanation":"光譜儀內任何環境變化都會直接變成譜線位移：空氣折射率 n − 1 ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁴ 隨壓力改變而使所有波長整體平移，溫度則改變光柵週期、光學座長度與偵測器位置。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Any environmental change inside a spectrograph becomes a line shift: the refractive index of air, n − 1 ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁴, varies with pressure and translates all wavelengths together, while temperature changes grating period, bench length and detector position. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a472-v12-14","title":"真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計：定量估算","titleEn":"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「真空容器與溫控屏蔽」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Vacuum vessel and thermal shields” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：空氣 dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷/hPa，每 1 hPa 壓力變化造成 c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s 的假速度；抽到 10⁻⁵ hPa 並保持穩定時降為 0.8 mm/s。Zerodur 光柵 α = 5×10⁻⁸/K、ΔT = 1 mK 給 c·α·ΔT ≈ 1.5 cm/s；但 0.1 m 長的鋁偵測器支架每 mK 伸長 2.3 nm，以 18.7 nm/(m/s) 換算為 0.12 m/s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Air has dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷ per hPa, so a 1 hPa pressure change fakes c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s, falling to 0.8 mm/s when pumped to a stable 10⁻⁵ hPa. A Zerodur grating with α = 5×10⁻⁸/K and ΔT = 1 mK gives c·α·ΔT ≈ 1.5 cm/s, but a 0.1 m aluminium detector mount grows 2.3 nm per mK, which at 18.7 nm per m/s is 0.12 m/s. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在容器內的光學座、光柵與偵測器頭部布置校正過的鉑電阻溫度計，長期記錄溫度與真空計讀數；同時以同步參考光纖的 ThAr 或標準具譜線量測夜間漂移，把漂移對溫度與壓力做回歸，得出 m/s/mK 與 m/s/hPa 係數並與模型比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Fit calibrated platinum resistance thermometers to the bench, grating and detector head inside the vessel and log them with vacuum-gauge readings for weeks; simultaneously measure nightly drift with ThAr or etalon lines through the simultaneous-reference fibre, regress drift against temperature and pressure, and compare the fitted m/s per mK and m/s per hPa coefficients with the model.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"空氣 dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷/hPa，每 1 hPa 壓力變化造成 c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s 的假速度；抽到 10⁻⁵ hPa 並保持穩定時降為 0.8 mm/s。Zerodur 光柵 α = 5×10⁻⁸/K、ΔT = 1 mK 給 c·α·ΔT ≈ 1.5 cm/s；但 0.1 m 長的鋁偵測器支架每 mK 伸長 2.3 nm，以 18.7 nm/(m/s) 換算為 0.12 m/s。","textEn":"Air has dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷ per hPa, so a 1 hPa pressure change fakes c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s, falling to 0.8 mm/s when pumped to a stable 10⁻⁵ hPa. A Zerodur grating with α = 5×10⁻⁸/K and ΔT = 1 mK gives c·α·ΔT ≈ 1.5 cm/s, but a 0.1 m aluminium detector mount grows 2.3 nm per mK, which at 18.7 nm per m/s is 0.12 m/s.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability\", which statement holds?","options":["CCD 像素是完美等距網格，只需校正波長即可。","解析力越高，RV 精度一定越好，不必考慮光子數。","空氣 dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷/hPa，每 1 hPa 壓力變化造成 c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s 的假速度。"],"optionsEn":["CCD pixels form a perfect grid, so only wavelength needs calibrating.","Higher resolving power always improves RV precision regardless of photon count.","Air has dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷ per hPa, so a 1 hPa pressure change fakes c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s, falling to 0.8 mm/s when pumped to a stable 10⁻⁵ hPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"空氣 dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷/hPa，每 1 hPa 壓力變化造成 c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s 的假速度；抽到 10⁻⁵ hPa 並保持穩定時降為 0.8 mm/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Air has dn/dP ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁷ per hPa, so a 1 hPa pressure change fakes c×2.7×10⁻⁷ ≈ 80 m/s, falling to 0.8 mm/s when pumped to a stable 10⁻⁵ hPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a472-v12-15","title":"真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「真空容器與溫控屏蔽」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Vacuum vessel and thermal shields” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在容器內的光學座、光柵與偵測器頭部布置校正過的鉑電阻溫度計，長期記錄溫度與真空計讀數；同時以同步參考光纖的 ThAr 或標準具譜線量測夜間漂移，把漂移對溫度與壓力做回歸，得出 m/s/mK 與 m/s/hPa 係數並與模型比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Fit calibrated platinum resistance thermometers to the bench, grating and detector head inside the vessel and log them with vacuum-gauge readings for weeks; simultaneously measure nightly drift with ThAr or etalon lines through the simultaneous-reference fibre, regress drift against temperature and pressure, and compare the fitted m/s per mK and m/s per hPa coefficients with the model. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：偵測器冷卻循環或液氮補充造成的熱脈衝經支架傳到光學座，產生與觀測排程相關的 m/s 級跳動；若真空容器洩漏率逐漸上升，壓力漂移帶來緩慢的速度趨勢，很容易被誤認為長週期行星。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Thermal pulses from detector cooling cycles or liquid-nitrogen refills conduct through mounts to the bench and create m/s-level jumps correlated with the observing schedule; a slowly rising vacuum leak rate produces a pressure drift and a gradual velocity trend that is easily mistaken for a long-period planet.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在容器內的光學座、光柵與偵測器頭部布置校正過的鉑電阻溫度計，長期記錄溫度與真空計讀數；同時以同步參考光纖的 ThAr 或標準具譜線量測夜間漂移，把漂移對溫度與壓力做回歸，得出 m/s/mK 與 m/s/hPa 係數並與模型比較。","textEn":"Fit calibrated platinum resistance thermometers to the bench, grating and detector head inside the vessel and log them with vacuum-gauge readings for weeks; simultaneously measure nightly drift with ThAr or etalon lines through the simultaneous-reference fibre, regress drift against temperature and pressure, and compare the fitted m/s per mK and m/s per hPa coefficients with the model.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability\"?","options":["在容器內的光學座、光柵與偵測器頭部布置校正過的鉑電阻溫度計，長期記錄溫度與真空計讀數。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","階梯光柵刻線越密，角色散就越大。"],"optionsEn":["Fit calibrated platinum resistance thermometers to the bench, grating and detector head inside the vessel and log them with vacuum-gauge readings for weeks.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A more finely ruled echelle always gives larger angular dispersion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在容器內的光學座、光柵與偵測器頭部布置校正過的鉑電阻溫度計，長期記錄溫度與真空計讀數；同時以同步參考光纖的 ThAr 或標準具譜線量測夜間漂移，把漂移對溫度與壓力做回歸，得出 m/s/mK 與 m/s/hPa 係數並與模型比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Fit calibrated platinum resistance thermometers to the bench, grating and detector head inside the vessel and log them with vacuum-gauge readings for weeks; simultaneously measure nightly drift with ThAr or etalon lines through the simultaneous-reference fibre, regress drift against temperature and pressure, and compare the fitted m/s per mK and m/s per hPa coefficients with the model. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a472-v12-16","title":"真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計：失效診斷","titleEn":"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「真空容器與溫控屏蔽」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Vacuum vessel and thermal shields” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"偵測器冷卻循環或液氮補充造成的熱脈衝經支架傳到光學座，產生與觀測排程相關的 m/s 級跳動；若真空容器洩漏率逐漸上升，壓力漂移帶來緩慢的速度趨勢，很容易被誤認為長週期行星。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Thermal pulses from detector cooling cycles or liquid-nitrogen refills conduct through mounts to the bench and create m/s-level jumps correlated with the observing schedule; a slowly rising vacuum leak rate produces a pressure drift and a gradual velocity trend that is easily mistaken for a long-period planet. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：因此 HARPS 與 ESPRESSO 類儀器把光學平台放進真空容器，外加多層主動溫控屏蔽，以 mK 等級的長期穩定為目標；光學座採用低膨脹材料或同材料對稱結構，偵測器有獨立的低溫恆溫器，電子設備與真空泵等熱源移到容器之外。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: HARPS- and ESPRESSO-class instruments therefore put the optical bench inside a vacuum vessel wrapped in nested actively controlled thermal shields aiming at mK-level long-term stability; benches use low-expansion or symmetric same-material structures, the detector has its own cryostat, and heat sources such as electronics and vacuum pumps are moved outside the vessel.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要光柵用零膨脹材料，溫度就不再重要。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the grating is made of zero-expansion material, temperature no longer matters.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"偵測器冷卻循環或液氮補充造成的熱脈衝經支架傳到光學座，產生與觀測排程相關的 m/s 級跳動；若真空容器洩漏率逐漸上升，壓力漂移帶來緩慢的速度趨勢，很容易被誤認為長週期行星。","textEn":"Thermal pulses from detector cooling cycles or liquid-nitrogen refills conduct through mounts to the bench and create m/s-level jumps correlated with the observing schedule; a slowly rising vacuum leak rate produces a pressure drift and a gradual velocity trend that is easily mistaken for a long-period planet.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「真空、溫度與壓力穩定的機構設計」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Vacuum, temperature and pressure stability\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","偵測器冷卻循環或液氮補充造成的熱脈衝經支架傳到光學座，產生與觀測排程相關的 m/s 級跳動。","ThAr 譜線夠多就能精準校正，不需要其他光源。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Thermal pulses from detector cooling cycles or liquid-nitrogen refills conduct through mounts to the bench and create m/s-level jumps correlated with the observing schedule.","Enough ThAr lines alone give precise calibration without any other source."],"answer":1,"explanation":"偵測器冷卻循環或液氮補充造成的熱脈衝經支架傳到光學座，產生與觀測排程相關的 m/s 級跳動；若真空容器洩漏率逐漸上升，壓力漂移帶來緩慢的速度趨勢，很容易被誤認為長週期行星。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Thermal pulses from detector cooling cycles or liquid-nitrogen refills conduct through mounts to the bench and create m/s-level jumps correlated with the observing schedule; a slowly rising vacuum leak rate produces a pressure drift and a gradual velocity trend that is easily mistaken for a long-period planet. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a472-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳」與「光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs\" and \"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a472-v12-17","title":"波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「ThAr 燈、標準具與雷射頻率梳」如何決定天文高解析光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “ThAr lamp, etalon and laser frequency comb” determines the key performance of “High-resolution astronomical spectrographs”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"波長解把像素位置對應到真空波長，校正源決定能達到的精度。ThAr 空心陰極燈提供數千條絕對波長已知的譜線，但亮度差異大、彼此混疊，氬線隨燈壓位移且燈管會老化；Fabry–Pérot 標準具產生間距均勻、亮度一致的密集譜線，適合描繪像素尺度的色散，但絕對位置隨腔長漂移，需要用 ThAr 或原子譜線錨定。雷射頻率梳的每條梳齒 f_n = f_ceo + n·f_rep 由原子鐘參考，間距需經濾波腔放大到 15 至 30 GHz 才能被光譜儀解析，提供最高的準確度與可重現性。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「ThAr 燈、標準具與雷射頻率梳」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The wavelength solution maps pixel position to vacuum wavelength, and the calibration source sets the attainable precision. ThAr hollow-cathode lamps give thousands of lines with known absolute wavelengths, but their brightness varies widely, lines blend, argon lines shift with lamp pressure and lamps age; Fabry–Pérot etalons give dense, evenly spaced lines of uniform brightness that map dispersion at pixel scale, but their absolute positions drift with cavity length and must be anchored to ThAr or atomic lines. A laser frequency comb, with each tooth at f_n = f_ceo + n·f_rep referenced to an atomic clock, needs filter cavities to raise its spacing to 15 to 30 GHz so the spectrograph can resolve it, and delivers the highest accuracy and repeatability. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “ThAr lamp, etalon and laser frequency comb”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：真空間隙 L = 7.5 mm 的標準具 FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz，在 550 nm 對應 Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm，約為 R = 140 000 解析元素（3.93 pm）的 5.1 倍，譜線彼此分離。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: An etalon with a 7.5 mm vacuum gap has FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz, or Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm at 550 nm, about 5.1 times the 3.93 pm resolution element at R = 140 000, so lines are well separated.","failure":"常見誤解：「ThAr 譜線夠多就能精準校正，不需要其他光源。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Enough ThAr lines alone give precise calibration without any other source.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「ThAr 燈、標準具與雷射頻率梳」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “ThAr lamp, etalon and laser frequency comb”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-17-k1","title":"波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳","titleEn":"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs","text":"波長解把像素位置對應到真空波長，校正源決定能達到的精度。ThAr 空心陰極燈提供數千條絕對波長已知的譜線，但亮度差異大、彼此混疊，氬線隨燈壓位移且燈管會老化；Fabry–Pérot 標準具產生間距均勻、亮度一致的密集譜線，適合描繪像素尺度的色散，但絕對位置隨腔長漂移，需要用 ThAr 或原子譜線錨定。","textEn":"The wavelength solution maps pixel position to vacuum wavelength, and the calibration source sets the attainable precision. ThAr hollow-cathode lamps give thousands of lines with known absolute wavelengths, but their brightness varies widely, lines blend, argon lines shift with lamp pressure and lamps age; Fabry–Pérot etalons give dense, evenly spaced lines of uniform brightness that map dispersion at pixel scale, but their absolute positions drift with cavity length and must be anchored to ThAr or atomic lines.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：ThAr 譜線夠多就能精準校正，不需要其他光源。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Enough ThAr lines alone give precise calibration without any other source. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs\" is correct?","options":["ThAr 譜線夠多就能精準校正，不需要其他光源。","曝光時間一直加倍，RV 誤差就會無限下降。","波長解把像素位置對應到真空波長，校正源決定能達到的精度。"],"optionsEn":["Enough ThAr lines alone give precise calibration without any other source.","Doubling the exposure time keeps reducing RV error without limit.","The wavelength solution maps pixel position to vacuum wavelength, and the calibration source sets the attainable precision."],"answer":2,"explanation":"波長解把像素位置對應到真空波長，校正源決定能達到的精度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The wavelength solution maps pixel position to vacuum wavelength, and the calibration source sets the attainable precision. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a472-v12-18","title":"波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳：定量估算","titleEn":"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「ThAr 燈、標準具與雷射頻率梳」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “ThAr lamp, etalon and laser frequency comb” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：真空間隙 L = 7.5 mm 的標準具 FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz，在 550 nm 對應 Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm，約為 R = 140 000 解析元素（3.93 pm）的 5.1 倍，譜線彼此分離。要穩定到 1 m/s，腔長變化須小於 L×(1 m/s)/c = 25 pm。250 MHz 頻率梳經 100 倍濾波得 25 GHz 間距，譜線間隔 25.2 pm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: An etalon with a 7.5 mm vacuum gap has FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz, or Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm at 550 nm, about 5.1 times the 3.93 pm resolution element at R = 140 000, so lines are well separated. Holding it to 1 m/s requires the gap to change by less than L×(1 m/s)/c = 25 pm. A 250 MHz comb filtered by a factor of 100 gives 25 GHz spacing, lines every 25.2 pm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：每晚以 ThAr 與標準具或頻率梳各取一組校正影像，對每一級擬合二維多項式或分段色散解，把殘差 rms 換算成速度並與光子雜訊預期比較；比較 ThAr 解與頻率梳解的差值可揭露像素尺寸不均與譜線表誤差，連續多晚追蹤標準具譜線可得其漂移斜率。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Each night take ThAr and etalon or comb calibration frames, fit a two-dimensional polynomial or piecewise dispersion solution per order, convert residual rms to velocity and compare with the photon-noise expectation; differencing the ThAr and comb solutions exposes pixel-size non-uniformity and line-list errors, and tracking etalon lines over several nights yields the etalon drift slope.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"真空間隙 L = 7.5 mm 的標準具 FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz，在 550 nm 對應 Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm，約為 R = 140 000 解析元素（3.93 pm）的 5.1 倍，譜線彼此分離。要穩定到 1 m/s，腔長變化須小於 L×(1 m/s)/c = 25 pm。250 MHz 頻率梳經 100 倍濾波得 25 GHz 間距，譜線間隔 25.2 pm。","textEn":"An etalon with a 7.5 mm vacuum gap has FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz, or Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm at 550 nm, about 5.1 times the 3.93 pm resolution element at R = 140 000, so lines are well separated. Holding it to 1 m/s requires the gap to change by less than L×(1 m/s)/c = 25 pm. A 250 MHz comb filtered by a factor of 100 gives 25 GHz spacing, lines every 25.2 pm.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs\", which statement holds?","options":["真空間隙 L = 7.5 mm 的標準具 FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz，在 550 nm 對應 Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm，約為 R = 140 000 解析元素（3.93 pm）的 5.1 倍，譜線彼此分離。","重心修正只要用曝光開始時間計算即可。","階梯光柵刻線越密，角色散就越大。"],"optionsEn":["An etalon with a 7.5 mm vacuum gap has FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz, or Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm at 550 nm, about 5.1 times the 3.93 pm resolution element at R = 140 000, so lines are well separated.","Barycentric correction can simply use the exposure start time.","A more finely ruled echelle always gives larger angular dispersion."],"answer":0,"explanation":"真空間隙 L = 7.5 mm 的標準具 FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz，在 550 nm 對應 Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm，約為 R = 140 000 解析元素（3.93 pm）的 5.1 倍，譜線彼此分離。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"An etalon with a 7.5 mm vacuum gap has FSR = c/(2L) = 20.0 GHz, or Δλ = λ²·FSR/c = 20.2 pm at 550 nm, about 5.1 times the 3.93 pm resolution element at R = 140 000, so lines are well separated. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a472-v12-19","title":"波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「ThAr 燈、標準具與雷射頻率梳」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “ThAr lamp, etalon and laser frequency comb” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"每晚以 ThAr 與標準具或頻率梳各取一組校正影像，對每一級擬合二維多項式或分段色散解，把殘差 rms 換算成速度並與光子雜訊預期比較；比較 ThAr 解與頻率梳解的差值可揭露像素尺寸不均與譜線表誤差，連續多晚追蹤標準具譜線可得其漂移斜率。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Each night take ThAr and etalon or comb calibration frames, fit a two-dimensional polynomial or piecewise dispersion solution per order, convert residual rms to velocity and compare with the photon-noise expectation; differencing the ThAr and comb solutions exposes pixel-size non-uniformity and line-list errors, and tracking etalon lines over several nights yields the etalon drift slope. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：頻率梳濾波腔失鎖時，被抑制的鄰近梳齒重新出現，每條譜線變成不對稱的混疊，重心偏移數 m/s 卻仍看似正常譜線；更換 ThAr 燈管後若沒有重新建立參考，氬線壓力位移會讓整個波長解出現跳點。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: When a comb's filter cavity loses lock, suppressed neighbouring modes reappear and each line becomes an asymmetric blend whose centroid moves several m/s while still looking normal; replacing a ThAr lamp without re-establishing the reference lets argon pressure shifts introduce a jump into the whole wavelength solution.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每晚以 ThAr 與標準具或頻率梳各取一組校正影像，對每一級擬合二維多項式或分段色散解，把殘差 rms 換算成速度並與光子雜訊預期比較；比較 ThAr 解與頻率梳解的差值可揭露像素尺寸不均與譜線表誤差，連續多晚追蹤標準具譜線可得其漂移斜率。","textEn":"Each night take ThAr and etalon or comb calibration frames, fit a two-dimensional polynomial or piecewise dispersion solution per order, convert residual rms to velocity and compare with the photon-noise expectation; differencing the ThAr and comb solutions exposes pixel-size non-uniformity and line-list errors, and tracking etalon lines over several nights yields the etalon drift slope.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","每晚以 ThAr 與標準具或頻率梳各取一組校正影像，對每一級擬合二維多項式或分段色散解，把殘差 rms 換算成速度並與光子雜訊預期比較。","光纖只是傳光線，對 RV 精度沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Each night take ThAr and etalon or comb calibration frames, fit a two-dimensional polynomial or piecewise dispersion solution per order, convert residual rms to velocity and compare with the photon-noise expectation.","A fibre only carries light and has no effect on RV precision."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每晚以 ThAr 與標準具或頻率梳各取一組校正影像，對每一級擬合二維多項式或分段色散解，把殘差 rms 換算成速度並與光子雜訊預期比較；比較 ThAr 解與頻率梳解的差值可揭露像素尺寸不均與譜線表誤差，連續多晚追蹤標準具譜線可得其漂移斜率。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Each night take ThAr and etalon or comb calibration frames, fit a two-dimensional polynomial or piecewise dispersion solution per order, convert residual rms to velocity and compare with the photon-noise expectation; differencing the ThAr and comb solutions exposes pixel-size non-uniformity and line-list errors, and tracking etalon lines over several nights yields the etalon drift slope. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a472-v12-20","title":"波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳：失效診斷","titleEn":"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「ThAr 燈、標準具與雷射頻率梳」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “ThAr lamp, etalon and laser frequency comb” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"頻率梳濾波腔失鎖時，被抑制的鄰近梳齒重新出現，每條譜線變成不對稱的混疊，重心偏移數 m/s 卻仍看似正常譜線；更換 ThAr 燈管後若沒有重新建立參考，氬線壓力位移會讓整個波長解出現跳點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"When a comb's filter cavity loses lock, suppressed neighbouring modes reappear and each line becomes an asymmetric blend whose centroid moves several m/s while still looking normal; replacing a ThAr lamp without re-establishing the reference lets argon pressure shifts introduce a jump into the whole wavelength solution. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：雷射頻率梳的每條梳齒 f_n = f_ceo + n·f_rep 由原子鐘參考，間距需經濾波腔放大到 15 至 30 GHz 才能被光譜儀解析，提供最高的準確度與可重現性。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A laser frequency comb, with each tooth at f_n = f_ceo + n·f_rep referenced to an atomic clock, needs filter cavities to raise its spacing to 15 to 30 GHz so the spectrograph can resolve it, and delivers the highest accuracy and repeatability.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「ThAr 譜線夠多就能精準校正，不需要其他光源。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Enough ThAr lines alone give precise calibration without any other source.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"頻率梳濾波腔失鎖時，被抑制的鄰近梳齒重新出現，每條譜線變成不對稱的混疊，重心偏移數 m/s 卻仍看似正常譜線；更換 ThAr 燈管後若沒有重新建立參考，氬線壓力位移會讓整個波長解出現跳點。","textEn":"When a comb's filter cavity loses lock, suppressed neighbouring modes reappear and each line becomes an asymmetric blend whose centroid moves several m/s while still looking normal; replacing a ThAr lamp without re-establishing the reference lets argon pressure shifts introduce a jump into the whole wavelength solution.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「波長校正源：ThAr、標準具與頻率梳」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Wavelength calibration: ThAr, etalons and frequency combs\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","曝光時間一直加倍，RV 誤差就會無限下降。","頻率梳濾波腔失鎖時，被抑制的鄰近梳齒重新出現，每條譜線變成不對稱的混疊，重心偏移數 m/s 卻仍看似正常譜線。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Doubling the exposure time keeps reducing RV error without limit.","When a comb's filter cavity loses lock, suppressed neighbouring modes reappear and each line becomes an asymmetric blend whose centroid moves several m/s while still looking normal."],"answer":2,"explanation":"頻率梳濾波腔失鎖時，被抑制的鄰近梳齒重新出現，每條譜線變成不對稱的混疊，重心偏移數 m/s 卻仍看似正常譜線；更換 ThAr 燈管後若沒有重新建立參考，氬線壓力位移會讓整個波長解出現跳點。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"When a comb's filter cavity loses lock, suppressed neighbouring modes reappear and each line becomes an asymmetric blend whose centroid moves several m/s while still looking normal; replacing a ThAr lamp without re-establishing the reference lets argon pressure shifts introduce a jump into the whole wavelength solution. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a472-v12-21","title":"光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「光子雜訊與 RV 誤差預算表」如何決定天文高解析光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Photon noise and RV budget table” determines the key performance of “High-resolution astronomical spectrographs”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"在光子雜訊限制下，RV 不確定度 σ_v = c/(Q·√N_e)，N_e 是全部光譜收集到的光電子數，品質因子 Q 描述光譜中譜線的密度與陡度：低溫、慢自轉的 K 矮星 Q 高，高溫、快自轉的 A 型星 Q 很低。實際精度還要加上儀器項：校正源、光纖照明變化、偵測器、熱機構漂移與地球大氣吸收線污染，各項以均方根相加。預算表的目的是讓每個子系統負責人事先知道自己能分到多少誤差，而不是事後找解釋。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「光子雜訊與 RV 誤差預算表」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"In the photon-noise limit the RV uncertainty is σ_v = c/(Q·√N_e), where N_e is the number of photoelectrons collected over the spectrum and the quality factor Q describes line density and steepness: cool, slowly rotating K dwarfs have high Q while hot, fast-rotating A stars have very low Q. Real precision adds instrumental terms, namely calibration source, fibre-illumination changes, detector, thermo-mechanical drift and telluric-line contamination, combined root-sum-square. The budget table tells each subsystem owner in advance how much error they may consume rather than explaining failures afterwards. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Photon noise and RV budget table”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：取 Q = 15 000（教學假設）、N_e = 10⁸：σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s；要達 0.1 m/s 需 N_e = (3×10⁸/1500)² ≈ 4×10¹⁰。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Taking Q = 15 000 as a teaching assumption and N_e = 10⁸, σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s; reaching 0.1 m/s needs N_e = (3×10⁸/1500)² ≈ 4×10¹⁰.","failure":"常見誤解：「曝光時間一直加倍，RV 誤差就會無限下降。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Doubling the exposure time keeps reducing RV error without limit.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「光子雜訊與 RV 誤差預算表」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Photon noise and RV budget table”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-21-k1","title":"光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算","titleEn":"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget","text":"在光子雜訊限制下，RV 不確定度 σ_v = c/(Q·√N_e)，N_e 是全部光譜收集到的光電子數，品質因子 Q 描述光譜中譜線的密度與陡度：低溫、慢自轉的 K 矮星 Q 高，高溫、快自轉的 A 型星 Q 很低。實際精度還要加上儀器項：校正源、光纖照明變化、偵測器、熱機構漂移與地球大氣吸收線污染，各項以均方根相加。","textEn":"In the photon-noise limit the RV uncertainty is σ_v = c/(Q·√N_e), where N_e is the number of photoelectrons collected over the spectrum and the quality factor Q describes line density and steepness: cool, slowly rotating K dwarfs have high Q while hot, fast-rotating A stars have very low Q. Real precision adds instrumental terms, namely calibration source, fibre-illumination changes, detector, thermo-mechanical drift and telluric-line contamination, combined root-sum-square.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：曝光時間一直加倍，RV 誤差就會無限下降。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Doubling the exposure time keeps reducing RV error without limit. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget\" is correct?","options":["在光子雜訊限制下，RV 不確定度 σ_v = c/(Q·√N_e)，N_e 是全部光譜收集到的光電子數，品質因子 Q 描述光譜中譜線的密度與陡度：低溫、慢自轉的 K 矮星 Q 高，高溫、快自轉的 A 型星 Q 很低。","曝光時間一直加倍，RV 誤差就會無限下降。","CCD 像素是完美等距網格，只需校正波長即可。"],"optionsEn":["In the photon-noise limit the RV uncertainty is σ_v = c/(Q·√N_e), where N_e is the number of photoelectrons collected over the spectrum and the quality factor Q describes line density and steepness: cool, slowly rotating K dwarfs have high Q while hot, fast-rotating A stars have very low Q.","Doubling the exposure time keeps reducing RV error without limit.","CCD pixels form a perfect grid, so only wavelength needs calibrating."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在光子雜訊限制下，RV 不確定度 σ_v = c/(Q·√N_e)，N_e 是全部光譜收集到的光電子數，品質因子 Q 描述光譜中譜線的密度與陡度：低溫、慢自轉的 K 矮星 Q 高，高溫、快自轉的 A 型星 Q 很低。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"In the photon-noise limit the RV uncertainty is σ_v = c/(Q·√N_e), where N_e is the number of photoelectrons collected over the spectrum and the quality factor Q describes line density and steepness: cool, slowly rotating K dwarfs have high Q while hot, fast-rotating A stars have very low Q. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a472-v12-22","title":"光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「光子雜訊與 RV 誤差預算表」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Photon noise and RV budget table” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：取 Q = 15 000（教學假設）、N_e = 10⁸：σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s；要達 0.1 m/s 需 N_e = (3×10⁸/1500)² ≈ 4×10¹⁰。預算範例：光子 0.50、校正 0.10、光纖照明 0.10、偵測器 0.10、熱機構 0.05 m/s，RSS = √(0.25 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.0025) = 0.53 m/s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Taking Q = 15 000 as a teaching assumption and N_e = 10⁸, σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s; reaching 0.1 m/s needs N_e = (3×10⁸/1500)² ≈ 4×10¹⁰. Example budget: photon 0.50, calibration 0.10, fibre illumination 0.10, detector 0.10 and thermo-mechanical 0.05 m/s give RSS = √(0.25 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.0025) = 0.53 m/s. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：對每次曝光由萃取光譜計算光子雜訊 σ_v，與同一晚連續曝光的實際散佈比較，平方差即為未建模的儀器項；對 RV 標準星的長期序列計算 rms 與 Allan 偏差，若在數小時以上的時間尺度不再隨 1/√N 下降，代表儀器漂移或恆星活動等系統誤差主導。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compute the photon-noise σ_v of every exposure from its extracted spectrum and compare with the actual scatter of consecutive exposures in one night; the quadrature difference is the unmodelled instrumental term.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"取 Q = 15 000（教學假設）、N_e = 10⁸：σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s；要達 0.1 m/s 需 N_e = (3×10⁸/1500)² ≈ 4×10¹⁰。預算範例：光子 0.50、校正 0.10、光纖照明 0.10、偵測器 0.10、熱機構 0.05 m/s，RSS = √(0.25 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.0025) = 0.53 m/s。","textEn":"Taking Q = 15 000 as a teaching assumption and N_e = 10⁸, σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s; reaching 0.1 m/s needs N_e = (3×10⁸/1500)² ≈ 4×10¹⁰. Example budget: photon 0.50, calibration 0.10, fibre illumination 0.10, detector 0.10 and thermo-mechanical 0.05 m/s give RSS = √(0.25 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.01 + 0.0025) = 0.53 m/s.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget\", which statement holds?","options":["解析力越高，RV 精度一定越好，不必考慮光子數。","取 Q = 15 000（教學假設）、N_e = 10⁸：σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s。","光纖只是傳光線，對 RV 精度沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Higher resolving power always improves RV precision regardless of photon count.","Taking Q = 15 000 as a teaching assumption and N_e = 10⁸, σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s; reaching 0.1 m/s needs N_e = (3×10⁸/1500)² ≈ 4×10¹⁰.","A fibre only carries light and has no effect on RV precision."],"answer":1,"explanation":"取 Q = 15 000（教學假設）、N_e = 10⁸：σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s；要達 0.1 m/s 需 N_e = (3×10⁸/1500)² ≈ 4×10¹⁰。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Taking Q = 15 000 as a teaching assumption and N_e = 10⁸, σ_v = 3×10⁸/(15 000×10⁴) = 2.0 m/s; reaching 0.1 m/s needs N_e = (3×10⁸/1500)² ≈ 4×10¹⁰. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a472-v12-23","title":"光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「光子雜訊與 RV 誤差預算表」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Photon noise and RV budget table” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"對每次曝光由萃取光譜計算光子雜訊 σ_v，與同一晚連續曝光的實際散佈比較，平方差即為未建模的儀器項；對 RV 標準星的長期序列計算 rms 與 Allan 偏差，若在數小時以上的時間尺度不再隨 1/√N 下降，代表儀器漂移或恆星活動等系統誤差主導。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compute the photon-noise σ_v of every exposure from its extracted spectrum and compare with the actual scatter of consecutive exposures in one night; the quadrature difference is the unmodelled instrumental term. For long RV-standard series compute rms and Allan deviation, and if they stop falling as 1/√N beyond a few hours, systematics such as instrumental drift or stellar activity dominate. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：預算只列光子雜訊而忽略月光與天光在光纖中的污染，暗星在接近滿月時出現與月亮相對速度相關的 m/s 偏差；把溫度與焦點這類相關項目當成獨立項做 RSS，會低估總誤差並讓驗收表看似合格。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A budget that lists only photon noise ignores moonlight and sky contamination in the fibre, so faint stars near full Moon show m/s biases tied to the Moon's relative velocity; treating correlated terms such as temperature and focus as independent in the RSS underestimates the total and makes the acceptance table look compliant.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對每次曝光由萃取光譜計算光子雜訊 σ_v，與同一晚連續曝光的實際散佈比較，平方差即為未建模的儀器項；對 RV 標準星的長期序列計算 rms 與 Allan 偏差，若在數小時以上的時間尺度不再隨 1/√N 下降，代表儀器漂移或恆星活動等系統誤差主導。","textEn":"Compute the photon-noise σ_v of every exposure from its extracted spectrum and compare with the actual scatter of consecutive exposures in one night; the quadrature difference is the unmodelled instrumental term. For long RV-standard series compute rms and Allan deviation, and if they stop falling as 1/√N beyond a few hours, systematics such as instrumental drift or stellar activity dominate.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","只要光柵用零膨脹材料，溫度就不再重要。","對每次曝光由萃取光譜計算光子雜訊 σ_v，與同一晚連續曝光的實際散佈比較，平方差即為未建模的儀器項。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","If the grating is made of zero-expansion material, temperature no longer matters.","Compute the photon-noise σ_v of every exposure from its extracted spectrum and compare with the actual scatter of consecutive exposures in one night."],"answer":2,"explanation":"對每次曝光由萃取光譜計算光子雜訊 σ_v，與同一晚連續曝光的實際散佈比較，平方差即為未建模的儀器項；對 RV 標準星的長期序列計算 rms 與 Allan 偏差，若在數小時以上的時間尺度不再隨 1/√N 下降，代表儀器漂移或恆星活動等系統誤差主導。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compute the photon-noise σ_v of every exposure from its extracted spectrum and compare with the actual scatter of consecutive exposures in one night; the quadrature difference is the unmodelled instrumental term. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a472-v12-24","title":"光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「光子雜訊與 RV 誤差預算表」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Photon noise and RV budget table” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"預算只列光子雜訊而忽略月光與天光在光纖中的污染，暗星在接近滿月時出現與月亮相對速度相關的 m/s 偏差；把溫度與焦點這類相關項目當成獨立項做 RSS，會低估總誤差並讓驗收表看似合格。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A budget that lists only photon noise ignores moonlight and sky contamination in the fibre, so faint stars near full Moon show m/s biases tied to the Moon's relative velocity; treating correlated terms such as temperature and focus as independent in the RSS underestimates the total and makes the acceptance table look compliant. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：預算表的目的是讓每個子系統負責人事先知道自己能分到多少誤差，而不是事後找解釋。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The budget table tells each subsystem owner in advance how much error they may consume rather than explaining failures afterwards.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「曝光時間一直加倍，RV 誤差就會無限下降。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Doubling the exposure time keeps reducing RV error without limit.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"預算只列光子雜訊而忽略月光與天光在光纖中的污染，暗星在接近滿月時出現與月亮相對速度相關的 m/s 偏差；把溫度與焦點這類相關項目當成獨立項做 RSS，會低估總誤差並讓驗收表看似合格。","textEn":"A budget that lists only photon noise ignores moonlight and sky contamination in the fibre, so faint stars near full Moon show m/s biases tied to the Moon's relative velocity; treating correlated terms such as temperature and focus as independent in the RSS underestimates the total and makes the acceptance table look compliant.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光子雜訊極限與徑向速度誤差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Photon-noise limit and radial-velocity error budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["預算只列光子雜訊而忽略月光與天光在光纖中的污染，暗星在接近滿月時出現與月亮相對速度相關的 m/s 偏差。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","CCD 像素是完美等距網格，只需校正波長即可。"],"optionsEn":["A budget that lists only photon noise ignores moonlight and sky contamination in the fibre, so faint stars near full Moon show m/s biases tied to the Moon's relative velocity.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","CCD pixels form a perfect grid, so only wavelength needs calibrating."],"answer":0,"explanation":"預算只列光子雜訊而忽略月光與天光在光纖中的污染，暗星在接近滿月時出現與月亮相對速度相關的 m/s 偏差；把溫度與焦點這類相關項目當成獨立項做 RSS，會低估總誤差並讓驗收表看似合格。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A budget that lists only photon noise ignores moonlight and sky contamination in the fibre, so faint stars near full Moon show m/s biases tied to the Moon's relative velocity; treating correlated terms such as temperature and focus as independent in the RSS underestimates the total and makes the acceptance table look compliant. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a472-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取」與「重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Detector systematics and spectral extraction\" and \"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a472-v12-25","title":"偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Detector systematics and spectral extraction: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「大面積 CCD 與萃取管線」如何決定天文高解析光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Large CCD and extraction pipeline” determines the key performance of “High-resolution astronomical spectrographs”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"二維梯狀影像要經過級追蹤、散射光扣除、最佳萃取與閃耀函數平場校正，才得到每一級的一維光譜，再以交叉相關遮罩或模板比對求 RV。大面積 CCD 帶進三種與速度相關的系統誤差：電荷轉移效率不足使譜線向讀出方向拖尾，且拖尾比例隨通量改變；光罩拼接造成週期性的像素尺寸誤差；像素內量子效率不均。地球公轉使恆星譜線一年內在偵測器上來回移動數十個像素，這些誤差因此被轉成週期一年的假訊號。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「大面積 CCD 與萃取管線」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The two-dimensional ladder becomes one-dimensional spectra per order only after order tracing, scattered-light subtraction, optimal extraction and blaze flat-field correction, and RV is then derived by cross-correlation masks or template matching. Large CCDs add three velocity-related systematics: charge-transfer inefficiency trails lines toward the readout with a flux-dependent fraction, mask stitching creates periodic pixel-size errors, and quantum efficiency varies within each pixel. Earth's orbit sweeps stellar lines tens of pixels across the detector each year, turning these errors into spurious annual signals. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Large CCD and extraction pipeline”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：CTE = 0.999999、4096 次轉移後殘留比例 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41%，若這部分電荷延後一個像素，重心偏移 0.0041 px × 535 m/s = 2.2 m/s，低通量時更大。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With CTE = 0.999999, 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41% of the charge is left behind after 4096 transfers; deferred by one pixel it moves the centroid 0.0041 px × 535 m/s = 2.2 m/s, more at low flux.","failure":"常見誤解：「CCD 像素是完美等距網格，只需校正波長即可。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"CCD pixels form a perfect grid, so only wavelength needs calibrating.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「大面積 CCD 與萃取管線」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Large CCD and extraction pipeline”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-25-k1","title":"偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取","titleEn":"Detector systematics and spectral extraction","text":"二維梯狀影像要經過級追蹤、散射光扣除、最佳萃取與閃耀函數平場校正，才得到每一級的一維光譜，再以交叉相關遮罩或模板比對求 RV。大面積 CCD 帶進三種與速度相關的系統誤差：電荷轉移效率不足使譜線向讀出方向拖尾，且拖尾比例隨通量改變；光罩拼接造成週期性的像素尺寸誤差；像素內量子效率不均。","textEn":"The two-dimensional ladder becomes one-dimensional spectra per order only after order tracing, scattered-light subtraction, optimal extraction and blaze flat-field correction, and RV is then derived by cross-correlation masks or template matching. Large CCDs add three velocity-related systematics: charge-transfer inefficiency trails lines toward the readout with a flux-dependent fraction, mask stitching creates periodic pixel-size errors, and quantum efficiency varies within each pixel.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：CCD 像素是完美等距網格，只需校正波長即可。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: CCD pixels form a perfect grid, so only wavelength needs calibrating. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Detector systematics and spectral extraction\" is correct?","options":["CCD 像素是完美等距網格，只需校正波長即可。","二維梯狀影像要經過級追蹤、散射光扣除、最佳萃取與閃耀函數平場校正，才得到每一級的一維光譜，再以交叉相關遮罩或模板比對求 RV。","重心修正只要用曝光開始時間計算即可。"],"optionsEn":["CCD pixels form a perfect grid, so only wavelength needs calibrating.","The two-dimensional ladder becomes one-dimensional spectra per order only after order tracing, scattered-light subtraction, optimal extraction and blaze flat-field correction, and RV is then derived by cross-correlation masks or template matching.","Barycentric correction can simply use the exposure start time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"二維梯狀影像要經過級追蹤、散射光扣除、最佳萃取與閃耀函數平場校正，才得到每一級的一維光譜，再以交叉相關遮罩或模板比對求 RV。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The two-dimensional ladder becomes one-dimensional spectra per order only after order tracing, scattered-light subtraction, optimal extraction and blaze flat-field correction, and RV is then derived by cross-correlation masks or template matching. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a472-v12-26","title":"偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取：定量估算","titleEn":"Detector systematics and spectral extraction: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「大面積 CCD 與萃取管線」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Large CCD and extraction pipeline” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：CTE = 0.999999、4096 次轉移後殘留比例 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41%，若這部分電荷延後一個像素，重心偏移 0.0041 px × 535 m/s = 2.2 m/s，低通量時更大。地球軌道速度 ±30 km/s 使譜線移動 ±30 000/535 = ±56 px；10 nm 的拼接邊界誤差相當於 10/18.7 = 0.53 m/s 的跳動。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With CTE = 0.999999, 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41% of the charge is left behind after 4096 transfers; deferred by one pixel it moves the centroid 0.0041 px × 535 m/s = 2.2 m/s, more at low flux. Earth's orbital ±30 km/s sweeps lines by ±30 000/535 = ±56 px, so a 10 nm stitching-boundary error is a 10/18.7 = 0.53 m/s jump. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用不同強度的平場與標準具影像量測 CTE 與通量相依的重心偏移並建立修正表；改變標準具溫度或使用頻率梳讓譜線掃過偵測器，繪出每個拼接區塊的有效像素位置；以同一顆星不同訊噪比的曝光檢查 RV 是否與訊噪比相關。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure CTE and the flux-dependent centroid shift from flat-field and etalon frames at several intensities and build a correction table; tune the etalon temperature or use a comb to sweep lines across the detector and map the effective pixel positions of each stitching block; test whether RV correlates with signal-to-noise ratio using exposures of one star at different signal levels.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"CTE = 0.999999、4096 次轉移後殘留比例 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41%，若這部分電荷延後一個像素，重心偏移 0.0041 px × 535 m/s = 2.2 m/s，低通量時更大。地球軌道速度 ±30 km/s 使譜線移動 ±30 000/535 = ±56 px；10 nm 的拼接邊界誤差相當於 10/18.7 = 0.53 m/s 的跳動。","textEn":"With CTE = 0.999999, 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41% of the charge is left behind after 4096 transfers; deferred by one pixel it moves the centroid 0.0041 px × 535 m/s = 2.2 m/s, more at low flux. Earth's orbital ±30 km/s sweeps lines by ±30 000/535 = ±56 px, so a 10 nm stitching-boundary error is a 10/18.7 = 0.53 m/s jump.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Detector systematics and spectral extraction\", which statement holds?","options":["階梯光柵刻線越密，角色散就越大。","只要光柵用零膨脹材料，溫度就不再重要。","CTE = 0.999999、4096 次轉移後殘留比例 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41%，若這部分電荷延後一個像素，重心偏移 0.0041 px × 535 m/s = 2.2 m/s，低通量時更大。"],"optionsEn":["A more finely ruled echelle always gives larger angular dispersion.","If the grating is made of zero-expansion material, temperature no longer matters.","With CTE = 0.999999, 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41% of the charge is left behind after 4096 transfers."],"answer":2,"explanation":"CTE = 0.999999、4096 次轉移後殘留比例 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41%，若這部分電荷延後一個像素，重心偏移 0.0041 px × 535 m/s = 2.2 m/s，低通量時更大。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With CTE = 0.999999, 1 − CTE⁴⁰⁹⁶ = 0.41% of the charge is left behind after 4096 transfers; deferred by one pixel it moves the centroid 0.0041 px × 535 m/s = 2.2 m/s, more at low flux. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a472-v12-27","title":"偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Detector systematics and spectral extraction: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「大面積 CCD 與萃取管線」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Large CCD and extraction pipeline” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用不同強度的平場與標準具影像量測 CTE 與通量相依的重心偏移並建立修正表；改變標準具溫度或使用頻率梳讓譜線掃過偵測器，繪出每個拼接區塊的有效像素位置；以同一顆星不同訊噪比的曝光檢查 RV 是否與訊噪比相關。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure CTE and the flux-dependent centroid shift from flat-field and etalon frames at several intensities and build a correction table; tune the etalon temperature or use a comb to sweep lines across the detector and map the effective pixel positions of each stitching block; test whether RV correlates with signal-to-noise ratio using exposures of one star at different signal levels. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：管線若未修正拼接誤差，長期資料出現週期一年、振幅約 1 m/s 的訊號，恰與地球公轉同步，容易被誤報為適居帶行星；更換 CCD 控制器時序後 CTE 改變，前後資料出現無法解釋的零點偏移。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An uncorrected stitching error yields a one-year signal of about 1 m/s locked to Earth's orbit, easily misreported as a habitable-zone planet; changing the CCD controller timing alters CTE and leaves an unexplained zero-point offset between data taken before and after.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用不同強度的平場與標準具影像量測 CTE 與通量相依的重心偏移並建立修正表；改變標準具溫度或使用頻率梳讓譜線掃過偵測器，繪出每個拼接區塊的有效像素位置；以同一顆星不同訊噪比的曝光檢查 RV 是否與訊噪比相關。","textEn":"Measure CTE and the flux-dependent centroid shift from flat-field and etalon frames at several intensities and build a correction table; tune the etalon temperature or use a comb to sweep lines across the detector and map the effective pixel positions of each stitching block; test whether RV correlates with signal-to-noise ratio using exposures of one star at different signal levels.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Detector systematics and spectral extraction\"?","options":["用不同強度的平場與標準具影像量測 CTE 與通量相依的重心偏移並建立修正表。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","ThAr 譜線夠多就能精準校正，不需要其他光源。"],"optionsEn":["Measure CTE and the flux-dependent centroid shift from flat-field and etalon frames at several intensities and build a correction table.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Enough ThAr lines alone give precise calibration without any other source."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用不同強度的平場與標準具影像量測 CTE 與通量相依的重心偏移並建立修正表；改變標準具溫度或使用頻率梳讓譜線掃過偵測器，繪出每個拼接區塊的有效像素位置；以同一顆星不同訊噪比的曝光檢查 RV 是否與訊噪比相關。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure CTE and the flux-dependent centroid shift from flat-field and etalon frames at several intensities and build a correction table; tune the etalon temperature or use a comb to sweep lines across the detector and map the effective pixel positions of each stitching block; test whether RV correlates with signal-to-noise ratio using exposures of one star at different signal levels. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a472-v12-28","title":"偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取：失效診斷","titleEn":"Detector systematics and spectral extraction: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「大面積 CCD 與萃取管線」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Large CCD and extraction pipeline” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"管線若未修正拼接誤差，長期資料出現週期一年、振幅約 1 m/s 的訊號，恰與地球公轉同步，容易被誤報為適居帶行星；更換 CCD 控制器時序後 CTE 改變，前後資料出現無法解釋的零點偏移。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An uncorrected stitching error yields a one-year signal of about 1 m/s locked to Earth's orbit, easily misreported as a habitable-zone planet; changing the CCD controller timing alters CTE and leaves an unexplained zero-point offset between data taken before and after. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：地球公轉使恆星譜線一年內在偵測器上來回移動數十個像素，這些誤差因此被轉成週期一年的假訊號。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Earth's orbit sweeps stellar lines tens of pixels across the detector each year, turning these errors into spurious annual signals.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「CCD 像素是完美等距網格，只需校正波長即可。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"CCD pixels form a perfect grid, so only wavelength needs calibrating.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"管線若未修正拼接誤差，長期資料出現週期一年、振幅約 1 m/s 的訊號，恰與地球公轉同步，容易被誤報為適居帶行星；更換 CCD 控制器時序後 CTE 改變，前後資料出現無法解釋的零點偏移。","textEn":"An uncorrected stitching error yields a one-year signal of about 1 m/s locked to Earth's orbit, easily misreported as a habitable-zone planet; changing the CCD controller timing alters CTE and leaves an unexplained zero-point offset between data taken before and after.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「偵測器系統誤差與光譜萃取」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Detector systematics and spectral extraction\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","管線若未修正拼接誤差，長期資料出現週期一年、振幅約 1 m/s 的訊號，恰與地球公轉同步，容易被誤報為適居帶行星。","重心修正只要用曝光開始時間計算即可。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","An uncorrected stitching error yields a one-year signal of about 1 m/s locked to Earth's orbit, easily misreported as a habitable-zone planet.","Barycentric correction can simply use the exposure start time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"管線若未修正拼接誤差，長期資料出現週期一年、振幅約 1 m/s 的訊號，恰與地球公轉同步，容易被誤報為適居帶行星；更換 CCD 控制器時序後 CTE 改變，前後資料出現無法解釋的零點偏移。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An uncorrected stitching error yields a one-year signal of about 1 m/s locked to Earth's orbit, easily misreported as a habitable-zone planet; changing the CCD controller timing alters CTE and leaves an unexplained zero-point offset between data taken before and after. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a472-v12-29","title":"重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「曝光計、重心修正與 RV 標準星」如何決定天文高解析光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Exposure meter, barycentric correction, RV standards” determines the key performance of “High-resolution astronomical spectrographs”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"量到的速度包含地球自轉與公轉，必須修正到太陽系重心，而修正要用曝光期間光通量加權的中點時間，不是幾何中點；雲層或導星變化會讓兩者不同。曝光計在光譜儀內分出一小部分光，記錄通量隨時間的變化以求出加權時間。最後以多顆長期穩定的 RV 標準星、太陽光與校正源夜間漂移紀錄驗收整機，並把光纖組、溫控設定、校正序列與管線版本寫入交接文件。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「曝光計、重心修正與 RV 標準星」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Measured velocities contain Earth's rotation and orbital motion and must be corrected to the solar-system barycentre using the flux-weighted midpoint of the exposure rather than its geometric midpoint, since clouds or guiding changes make the two differ. An exposure meter picks off a small fraction of the light inside the spectrograph and records flux versus time to obtain that weighted time. Final acceptance uses several long-term RV-stable standards, sunlight and nightly calibration-drift records, and the handoff document fixes the fibre link, thermal set points, calibration sequence and pipeline version. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Exposure meter, barycentric correction, RV standards”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：在 La Silla（緯度 −29.26°）地球自轉速度 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s，其方向變化率 Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s²；15 分鐘曝光的加權中點若誤差 60 s，RV 誤差最大 0.030×60 ≈ 1.8 m/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At La Silla, latitude −29.26°, Earth's rotation speed is 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s and its direction turns at Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s²; a 60 s error in the flux-weighted midpoint of a 15-minute exposure gives up to 0.030×60 ≈ 1.8 m/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「重心修正只要用曝光開始時間計算即可。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Barycentric correction can simply use the exposure start time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「曝光計、重心修正與 RV 標準星」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Exposure meter, barycentric correction, RV standards”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-29-k1","title":"重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff","text":"量到的速度包含地球自轉與公轉，必須修正到太陽系重心，而修正要用曝光期間光通量加權的中點時間，不是幾何中點；雲層或導星變化會讓兩者不同。曝光計在光譜儀內分出一小部分光，記錄通量隨時間的變化以求出加權時間。","textEn":"Measured velocities contain Earth's rotation and orbital motion and must be corrected to the solar-system barycentre using the flux-weighted midpoint of the exposure rather than its geometric midpoint, since clouds or guiding changes make the two differ. An exposure meter picks off a small fraction of the light inside the spectrograph and records flux versus time to obtain that weighted time.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：重心修正只要用曝光開始時間計算即可。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Barycentric correction can simply use the exposure start time. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff\" is correct?","options":["重心修正只要用曝光開始時間計算即可。","解析力越高，RV 精度一定越好，不必考慮光子數。","量到的速度包含地球自轉與公轉，必須修正到太陽系重心，而修正要用曝光期間光通量加權的中點時間，不是幾何中點；雲層或導星變化會讓兩者不同。"],"optionsEn":["Barycentric correction can simply use the exposure start time.","Higher resolving power always improves RV precision regardless of photon count.","Measured velocities contain Earth's rotation and orbital motion and must be corrected to the solar-system barycentre using the flux-weighted midpoint of the exposure rather than its geometric midpoint, since clouds or guiding changes make the two differ."],"answer":2,"explanation":"量到的速度包含地球自轉與公轉，必須修正到太陽系重心，而修正要用曝光期間光通量加權的中點時間，不是幾何中點；雲層或導星變化會讓兩者不同。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Measured velocities contain Earth's rotation and orbital motion and must be corrected to the solar-system barycentre using the flux-weighted midpoint of the exposure rather than its geometric midpoint, since clouds or guiding changes make the two differ. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a472-v12-30","title":"重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「曝光計、重心修正與 RV 標準星」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Exposure meter, barycentric correction, RV standards” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：在 La Silla（緯度 −29.26°）地球自轉速度 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s，其方向變化率 Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s²；15 分鐘曝光的加權中點若誤差 60 s，RV 誤差最大 0.030×60 ≈ 1.8 m/s。公轉加速度 2π×29 780/(3.156×10⁷ s) ≈ 5.9×10⁻³ m/s²，同樣 60 s 只造成 0.36 m/s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At La Silla, latitude −29.26°, Earth's rotation speed is 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s and its direction turns at Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s²; a 60 s error in the flux-weighted midpoint of a 15-minute exposure gives up to 0.030×60 ≈ 1.8 m/s. The orbital acceleration 2π×29 780/(3.156×10⁷ s) ≈ 5.9×10⁻³ m/s² adds only 0.36 m/s for the same 60 s. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：驗收程序：連續 10 晚每晚取 ThAr 與標準具序列，日內漂移小於 1 m/s；三顆以上 RV 標準星每晚多次曝光，扣除光子雜訊後殘差小於 0.5 m/s；以獨立程式重算重心修正並比對到 1 cm/s；記錄真空度、溫度、光纖組號、韌體與管線版本，任何更動後都重做零點比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Acceptance: ThAr and etalon sequences on 10 consecutive nights with intra-night drift below 1 m/s; three or more RV standards observed several times nightly with residuals after photon noise below 0.5 m/s; barycentric corrections recomputed with independent code and matched to 1 cm/s; vacuum, temperatures, fibre-link ID, firmware and pipeline version logged, with a zero-point comparison repeated after any change.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"在 La Silla（緯度 −29.26°）地球自轉速度 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s，其方向變化率 Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s²；15 分鐘曝光的加權中點若誤差 60 s，RV 誤差最大 0.030×60 ≈ 1.8 m/s。公轉加速度 2π×29 780/(3.156×10⁷ s) ≈ 5.9×10⁻³ m/s²，同樣 60 s 只造成 0.36 m/s。","textEn":"At La Silla, latitude −29.26°, Earth's rotation speed is 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s and its direction turns at Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s²; a 60 s error in the flux-weighted midpoint of a 15-minute exposure gives up to 0.030×60 ≈ 1.8 m/s. The orbital acceleration 2π×29 780/(3.156×10⁷ s) ≈ 5.9×10⁻³ m/s² adds only 0.36 m/s for the same 60 s.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["在 La Silla（緯度 −29.26°）地球自轉速度 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s，其方向變化率 Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s²。","光纖只是傳光線，對 RV 精度沒有影響。","ThAr 譜線夠多就能精準校正，不需要其他光源。"],"optionsEn":["At La Silla, latitude −29.26°, Earth's rotation speed is 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s and its direction turns at Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s².","A fibre only carries light and has no effect on RV precision.","Enough ThAr lines alone give precise calibration without any other source."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在 La Silla（緯度 −29.26°）地球自轉速度 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s，其方向變化率 Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s²；15 分鐘曝光的加權中點若誤差 60 s，RV 誤差最大 0.030×60 ≈ 1.8 m/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At La Silla, latitude −29.26°, Earth's rotation speed is 465×cos29.26° ≈ 406 m/s and its direction turns at Ω·v = 7.29×10⁻⁵×406 ≈ 0.030 m/s²; a 60 s error in the flux-weighted midpoint of a 15-minute exposure gives up to 0.030×60 ≈ 1.8 m/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a472-v12-31","title":"重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「曝光計、重心修正與 RV 標準星」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Exposure meter, barycentric correction, RV standards” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"驗收程序：連續 10 晚每晚取 ThAr 與標準具序列，日內漂移小於 1 m/s；三顆以上 RV 標準星每晚多次曝光，扣除光子雜訊後殘差小於 0.5 m/s；以獨立程式重算重心修正並比對到 1 cm/s；記錄真空度、溫度、光纖組號、韌體與管線版本，任何更動後都重做零點比對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Acceptance: ThAr and etalon sequences on 10 consecutive nights with intra-night drift below 1 m/s; three or more RV standards observed several times nightly with residuals after photon noise below 0.5 m/s; barycentric corrections recomputed with independent code and matched to 1 cm/s; vacuum, temperatures, fibre-link ID, firmware and pipeline version logged, with a zero-point comparison repeated after any change. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：更換光纖組或校正源後若沒有用標準星重建零點，資料集出現數 m/s 的階梯偏移，與既有行星訊號混在一起要多年才能拆開；曝光計失效時改用幾何中點，雲天資料在高時角出現 m/s 級的額外散佈。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Replacing the fibre link or calibration source without re-establishing the zero point on standard stars leaves a step of several m/s in the dataset that takes years to disentangle from planet signals; when the exposure meter fails and the geometric midpoint is used instead, cloudy-night data at high hour angle gain extra m/s-level scatter.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"驗收程序：連續 10 晚每晚取 ThAr 與標準具序列，日內漂移小於 1 m/s；三顆以上 RV 標準星每晚多次曝光，扣除光子雜訊後殘差小於 0.5 m/s；以獨立程式重算重心修正並比對到 1 cm/s；記錄真空度、溫度、光纖組號、韌體與管線版本，任何更動後都重做零點比對。","textEn":"Acceptance: ThAr and etalon sequences on 10 consecutive nights with intra-night drift below 1 m/s; three or more RV standards observed several times nightly with residuals after photon noise below 0.5 m/s; barycentric corrections recomputed with independent code and matched to 1 cm/s; vacuum, temperatures, fibre-link ID, firmware and pipeline version logged, with a zero-point comparison repeated after any change.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","驗收程序：連續 10 晚每晚取 ThAr 與標準具序列，日內漂移小於 1 m/s。","曝光時間一直加倍，RV 誤差就會無限下降。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Acceptance: ThAr and etalon sequences on 10 consecutive nights with intra-night drift below 1 m/s.","Doubling the exposure time keeps reducing RV error without limit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"驗收程序：連續 10 晚每晚取 ThAr 與標準具序列，日內漂移小於 1 m/s；三顆以上 RV 標準星每晚多次曝光，扣除光子雜訊後殘差小於 0.5 m/s；以獨立程式重算重心修正並比對到 1 cm/s；記錄真空度、溫度、光纖組號、韌體與管線版本，任何更動後都重做零點比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Acceptance: ThAr and etalon sequences on 10 consecutive nights with intra-night drift below 1 m/s; three or more RV standards observed several times nightly with residuals after photon noise below 0.5 m/s; barycentric corrections recomputed with independent code and matched to 1 cm/s; vacuum, temperatures, fibre-link ID, firmware and pipeline version logged, with a zero-point comparison repeated after any change. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a472-v12-32","title":"重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"prerequisiteIds":["a472-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「曝光計、重心修正與 RV 標準星」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Exposure meter, barycentric correction, RV standards” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"更換光纖組或校正源後若沒有用標準星重建零點，資料集出現數 m/s 的階梯偏移，與既有行星訊號混在一起要多年才能拆開；曝光計失效時改用幾何中點，雲天資料在高時角出現 m/s 級的額外散佈。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Replacing the fibre link or calibration source without re-establishing the zero point on standard stars leaves a step of several m/s in the dataset that takes years to disentangle from planet signals; when the exposure meter fails and the geometric midpoint is used instead, cloudy-night data at high hour angle gain extra m/s-level scatter. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：最後以多顆長期穩定的 RV 標準星、太陽光與校正源夜間漂移紀錄驗收整機，並把光纖組、溫控設定、校正序列與管線版本寫入交接文件。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Final acceptance uses several long-term RV-stable standards, sunlight and nightly calibration-drift records, and the handoff document fixes the fibre link, thermal set points, calibration sequence and pipeline version.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「重心修正只要用曝光開始時間計算即可。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Barycentric correction can simply use the exposure start time.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a472-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"更換光纖組或校正源後若沒有用標準星重建零點，資料集出現數 m/s 的階梯偏移，與既有行星訊號混在一起要多年才能拆開；曝光計失效時改用幾何中點，雲天資料在高時角出現 m/s 級的額外散佈。","textEn":"Replacing the fibre link or calibration source without re-establishing the zero point on standard stars leaves a step of several m/s in the dataset that takes years to disentangle from planet signals; when the exposure meter fails and the geometric midpoint is used instead, cloudy-night data at high hour angle gain extra m/s-level scatter.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]},{"id":"a472-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「重心修正、天上驗證與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Barycentric correction, on-sky validation and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","解析力越高，RV 精度一定越好，不必考慮光子數。","更換光纖組或校正源後若沒有用標準星重建零點，資料集出現數 m/s 的階梯偏移，與既有行星訊號混在一起要多年才能拆開。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Higher resolving power always improves RV precision regardless of photon count.","Replacing the fibre link or calibration source without re-establishing the zero point on standard stars leaves a step of several m/s in the dataset that takes years to disentangle from planet signals."],"answer":2,"explanation":"更換光纖組或校正源後若沒有用標準星重建零點，資料集出現數 m/s 的階梯偏移，與既有行星訊號混在一起要多年才能拆開；曝光計失效時改用幾何中點，雲天資料在高時角出現 m/s 級的額外散佈。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Replacing the fibre link or calibration source without re-establishing the zero point on standard stars leaves a step of several m/s in the dataset that takes years to disentangle from planet signals; when the exposure meter fails and the geometric midpoint is used instead, cloudy-night data at high hour angle gain extra m/s-level scatter. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-espresso-instrument","v12o-eso-harps-instrument","v12o-espresso-next-exoplanet-hunter","v12o-astrocomb-precision-consistency"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
